RefreshOptimizationStatus	Refresh status (F5)	刷新状态（F5）
RefreshingOptimizationStatus	Refreshing status…	正在刷新状态…
OptimizationStatusRefreshFinished	Status refreshed.	状态已刷新。
OptimizationStatusRefreshPartial	Refresh finished, but {0} item(s) could not be checked. See logs for details.	刷新完成，有 {0} 项未能检测，详情请查看日志。
OptimizationStatusRefreshFailed	Failed to refresh status. Please try again.	刷新状态失败，请重试。
CheckForUpdates	Check for updates	检查更新
AutoUpdate	Auto-update	自动更新
CurrentVersionHeader	Current version: {0}	当前版本：{0}
BuildVersion	Version {0}	版本 {0}
ProjectHomepage	Project homepage	项目主页
DevelopmentBuild	Development build	开发版本
UpdateChecking	Checking for updates…	正在检查更新…
UpdateCheckFinished	Update check finished.	更新检查已完成。
UpdateAvailableTitle	Update available	发现新版本
UpdateAvailableMessage	Version {0} is ready. Restart and install now?	新版本 {0} 已就绪，是否立即重启并安装？
UpdateNoneTitle	Up to date	已是最新版本
UpdateNoneMessage	You are already using the latest version.	当前已经是最新版本，无需更新。
UpdateFailedTitle	Update check failed	检查更新失败
UpdateFailedMessage	Failed to check for updates: {0}	检查更新失败：{0}
UpdateLaunchFailedMessage	Failed to launch the updater script.	无法启动更新脚本。
UpdateDownloading	Downloading update… {0}%	正在下载更新… {0}%
UpdateDownloadFailedMessage	Failed to download the update: {0}	下载更新失败：{0}
SearchWatermark	Search settings and tools	搜索优化项或工具
ClearSearch	Clear search	清除搜索
NoSearchResultsInCurrentTab	No matching items in this tab.	当前标签页没有匹配结果。
ShowOnlyNotOptimized	Show only not optimized	仅显示未优化
NoUnoptimizedItemsInCurrentTab	Everything in this tab is already optimized.	当前标签页的项目均已优化。
GroupsNavTitle	Groups	分组导航
ExpandAllGroups	Expand all	全部展开
CollapseAllGroups	Collapse all	全部折叠
Language	Language	语言
Theme	Theme	主题
DefaultFontName	Microsoft YaHei UI, Segoe UI, sans-serif	Microsoft YaHei UI, Segoe UI, sans-serif
OptimizeSelectedItems	Optimize selected	一键优化选中项
OptimizeSelectedItemsWithExcludedCount	Optimize selected ({0} excluded)	一键优化选中项（已排除 {0} 项）
Initializing	Initializing…	正在初始化…
InitializationFinished	Ready.	初始化完成。
InitializationFailed	Initialization failed.	初始化失败。
OperatingItem	Applying: {0}…	正在操作：{0}…
OperatingItemFinished	Finished: {0}	操作完成：{0}
PreOptimizationPreparations	Preparing to optimize…	正在执行优化前准备…
OptimizingItem	Optimizing: {0}…	正在优化：{0}…
PostOptimizationProcessing	Finishing up…	正在执行后续刷新…
OptimizationCompleted	Optimization complete.	优化已完成。
TamperProtectionPromptMessage	Please turn off Tamper Protection in Windows Security, then click OK to continue.	请先在 Windows 安全中心中关闭“篡改防护”，然后点击“确定”继续。
RebootRequiredPromptMessage	Changes have been applied. Please restart Windows for them to take effect.	设置已应用，重启电脑后生效。
PleaseUninstallDriver	Please uninstall "{0}" and restart Windows to continue.	请先手动卸载“{0}”并重启电脑，然后再继续。
DriverRemovalFailedDetails	The following files or services could not be removed automatically:	以下残留文件或服务无法自动删除：
Optimizing	Optimizing	优化
OptimizingDescription	Recommended performance, stability, and usability tweaks with minimal or zero trade-offs. All power-plan tweaks apply only when plugged in (AC) without affecting battery life.	面向大多数电脑的高性价比优化项，兼顾流畅度、稳定性与简洁体验，副作用极小。其中电源方案相关项均仅在插电时生效，不影响电池续航。
Antivirus	Antivirus	防病毒
AntivirusDescription	Real-time antivirus hooks inspect every file read/write and noticeably slow down app launches, builds, and I/O. This tab detects installed third-party security products for manual removal; review security trade-offs carefully.	实时防病毒会拦截每次文件读写，对磁盘 I/O、软件启动与编译速度影响显著。本页用于检测已安装的第三方安全软件（卸载需手动确认），请结合自身安全需求谨慎权衡。
Personal	Personal	个性化
PersonalDescription	Useful optimizations that depend on personal habits or hardware setup—such as sleep/disk spin-down, hibernation, taskbar layout, or Xbox services. Review and enable what fits you.	同样实用的优化项，但是否开启取决于个人习惯或使用场景（如休眠、硬盘停转、任务栏布局、Xbox 服务等）。请逐项按需选择。
Optimized	Optimized	已优化
NotOptimized	Not optimized	未优化
