Taskbar	Taskbar	任务栏
StartMenu	Start Menu	开始菜单
Security	Security	安全
Privacy	Privacy	隐私
Software	Software	软件
UninstallOneDriveName	Uninstall OneDrive	卸载 OneDrive
UninstallOneDriveDescription	Removes the built-in OneDrive client to stop background syncing, tray prompts, and shell hooks. Does not delete files already in the cloud, and you can still access OneDrive via a browser or reinstall it anytime.\nEffective immediately.	移除自带 OneDrive 客户端，停止后台同步、托盘提示与资源管理器注入。不会删除云端已有文件，仍可随时通过网页访问或重新安装。\n立即生效。
DisableProgramCompatibilityAssistantServiceName	Disable Program Compatibility Assistant service	禁用程序兼容性助手服务
DisableProgramCompatibilityAssistantServiceDescription	Stops PcaSvc from monitoring every program you install or launch and popping up compatibility dialogs, reducing background overhead. Rarely solves real issues, and you can still set compatibility mode manually in a file's Properties.\nEffective immediately.	停止 PcaSvc 监控每次软件安装和启动，减少后台开销与无用弹窗。它很少真正解决兼容性问题，且仍可在文件属性中手动设置兼容模式。\n立即生效。
DisableDiagnosticPolicyServiceName	Disable Diagnostic Policy service	禁用诊断策略服务
DisableDiagnosticPolicyServiceDescription	Stops the background troubleshooting service (DPS) from collecting diagnostic data and running automated probes. Only disables Windows' built-in guided troubleshooters, which rarely fix real problems and do not affect normal system operation.\nEffective immediately.	停止后台诊断服务（DPS）持续收集诊断信息。仅会影响系统自带的“疑难解答”向导（实际作用有限），不影响任何正常系统功能。\n立即生效。
DisableWindowsSearchServiceName	Disable Windows Search indexing service	禁用 Windows 搜索索引服务
DisableWindowsSearchServiceDescription	Stops Windows Search from continuously crawling files and burning disk I/O and CPU in the background. Basic filename search still works (just slower), and free tools like Everything are far faster with almost no overhead.\nEffective immediately.	停止后台持续扫描和索引文件，明显降低磁盘读写与 CPU 占用。禁用后仍可搜索，只是未建索引会变慢；搭配 Everything 搜索文件更快且几乎零开销。\n立即生效。
DisableSysMainServiceName	Disable SysMain (Superfetch) service	禁用 SysMain（内存预加载）服务
DisableSysMainServiceDescription	Stops background app preloading and aggressive memory compression, cutting idle disk activity and occasional micro-stutters. Built for slow mechanical hard drives; on SSDs with 16 GB+ RAM the benefit is minimal, so turning it off has virtually no downside.\nEffective immediately.	停止后台预加载应用与高频内存压缩，减少空闲磁盘读写和偶发微卡顿。该服务主要为老旧机械硬盘设计，在 SSD + 大内存电脑上几乎没有加速效果，禁用几乎零代价。\n立即生效。
UninstallCortanaName	Uninstall Cortana	卸载 Cortana
UninstallCortanaDescription	Removes the legacy Cortana app package to free up clutter and background registration. Microsoft has retired consumer Cortana, so uninstalling it has zero impact on daily use.	移除旧版 Cortana 应用包，减少系统冗余。微软已停止面向个人用户的 Cortana 服务，卸载完全不影响日常使用。
UninstallSkypeName	Uninstall Skype	卸载 Skype
UninstallSkypeDescription	Removes the preinstalled Skype Store app to keep the Start menu and background updates clean. Can be reinstalled from Microsoft Store anytime if ever needed.	移除预装的 Skype 商店应用，减少开始菜单杂项与后台更新。若日后需要可随时从微软商店重新安装。
DisableWindowsRealTimeAntivirusName	Disable Windows Defender real-time scanning	禁用 Windows Defender 实时扫描
DisableWindowsRealTimeAntivirusDescription	Greatly speeds up file access, software builds, and app launches by turning off on-access scanning and behavior monitoring. Download scanning, threat alerts, and manual scans still remain; trade-off is reduced automatic protection against unknown executables—only disable if you practice safe download habits.\nEffective immediately.	关闭访问文件时的实时扫描与行为监控，可大幅加快文件读写、编译打包与软件启动速度。仍保留下载文件扫描、威胁提示和手动查杀；代价是降低了运行未知程序时的自动拦截能力，请结合自身上网习惯权衡。\n立即生效。
DisableMeltdownAndSpectrePatchesName	Disable Meltdown and Spectre mitigations	禁用 Meltdown 和 Spectre 漏洞缓解补丁
DisableMeltdownAndSpectrePatchesDescription	Reclaims CPU and syscall performance lost to speculative-execution mitigations, noticeably helping I/O-heavy workloads and older CPUs. Trade-off: weakens hardware-level isolation against side-channel exploits; acceptable for single-user personal PCs that do not run untrusted code.\nTakes effect after reboot.	恢复因 CPU 硬件漏洞软件缓解损失的系统调用与计算性能，对高频 I/O 和较老处理器提升更明显。代价是削弱对侧信道攻击的底层隔离；个人单用户电脑在不运行不可信代码时风险较低，请按需权衡。\n重启生效。
DisableKernelMemoryIntegrityProtectionName	Disable Kernel Memory Integrity (HVCI)	禁用内核内存完整性保护（HVCI）
DisableKernelMemoryIntegrityProtectionDescription	Turns off hypervisor-enforced code integrity to reduce virtualization overhead, often improving gaming frame rates, lowering latency, and fixing older driver compatibility. Trade-off: removes one kernel-level hardening layer, though standard Windows driver signing still remains active.\nTakes effect after reboot.	关闭基于虚拟化的代码完整性检查，可降低虚拟化开销、提升游戏帧率与响应速度并减少旧驱动兼容问题。代价是少一层内核加固，但系统标准的驱动签名校验依然生效。\n重启生效。
DisableWindowsDefenderApplicationControlName	Disable Smart App Control / Defender Application Control	禁用智能应用控制（WDAC）
DisableWindowsDefenderApplicationControlDescription	Stops Windows from verifying every launched executable against reputation policies, making apps start faster and preventing false blocks on unsigned tools. Trade-off: disables reputation-based execution blocking, which most power users and developers find overly restrictive.\nTakes effect after reboot.	停止启动应用时按云端信誉策略逐一拦截校验，加快应用打开速度并避免误拦开发工具或小众软件。代价是关闭基于信誉的拦截，对熟悉软件来源的用户基本无感。\n重启生效。
DisableWindowsDefenderPUAProtectionName	Disable Windows Defender PUA blocking	禁用 Windows Defender 潜在不受欢迎应用（PUA）拦截
DisableWindowsDefenderPUAProtectionDescription	Stops Defender from scanning and flagging "potentially unwanted" bundled installers, speeding up app launches and avoiding false positives on niche utilities. Does not disable core malware detection.\nEffective immediately.	停止对“潜在不受欢迎应用”的额外拦截检查，加快启动并减少对小众工具的误报。不会关闭核心病毒木马查杀。\n立即生效。
DisableSmartScreenName	Disable SmartScreen filter	禁用 SmartScreen 筛选器
DisableSmartScreenDescription	Removes online reputation checks before opening downloaded files and installers, making launches snappier and eliminating false "Windows protected your PC" blocks. Trade-off: skips Microsoft's cloud reputation warning, so verify download sources yourself.\nEffective immediately.	取消打开下载文件和安装包前的云端信誉检查，加快打开速度并减少“Windows 已保护你的电脑”误拦弹窗。代价是少了微软云端信誉提示，自行确认下载来源即可。\n立即生效。
DisableFastStartupName	Disable Fast Startup	禁用快速启动
DisableFastStartupDescription	Makes "Shut down" perform a real clean kernel shutdown instead of saving kernel state to disk, preventing driver glitches, memory leaks, Wake-on-LAN issues, and dual-boot filesystem corruption. On modern SSDs, cold boot is only 1–3 seconds slower—well worth the stability gain. (Has no effect if hibernation is off.)\nEffective immediately.	让“关机”执行真正的完整内核关闭，避免因长期保存旧内核状态引发的驱动异常、内存占用高、网卡异常及双系统磁盘损坏。在现代 SSD 上开机仅慢 1~3 秒，换来的稳定性完全值得。（关闭休眠后本项自动不生效。）\n立即生效。
DisableWindowsPlatformBinaryTableName	Disable OEM early-boot programs (WPBT)	禁用厂商开机早期运行程序（WPBT）
DisableWindowsPlatformBinaryTableDescription	Blocks motherboard/laptop firmware from silently injecting vendor utilities or bloatware during early Windows boot, improving cleanliness and security. Does not affect BIOS updates or normal drivers installed later.\nTakes effect after reboot.	阻止主板/笔记本固件在系统启动极早期静默注入厂商工具或推广软件，更干净也更安全。不影响正常驱动安装或 BIOS 更新。\n重启生效。
DisableSystemRestoreName	Disable System Restore	禁用系统还原
DisableSystemRestoreDescription	Stops Windows from automatically creating restore snapshots before updates and installs, freeing gigabytes of SSD space and speeding up patch/software installations. Trade-off: you cannot roll back via Windows restore points (use regular file/image backups instead if needed).\nEffective immediately.	停止在系统更新和安装软件时自动创建还原快照，可释放数 GB 磁盘空间并加快更新与安装速度。代价是无法使用系统还原点回退（重要系统可用镜像备份替代）。\n立即生效。
DisableMicrosoftCustomerExperienceImprovementProgramName	Disable Customer Experience Improvement Program (CEIP)	禁用微软客户体验改善计划（CEIP）
DisableMicrosoftCustomerExperienceImprovementProgramDescription	Stops Windows from collecting and uploading usage statistics to Microsoft, saving minor background work and improving privacy. Zero impact on any Windows feature.\nEffective immediately.	停止向微软收集和上传使用习惯统计数据，减少后台活动并保护隐私。对所有系统功能完全无影响。\n立即生效。
DisableUACName	Disable User Account Control (UAC)	禁用用户帐户控制（UAC）
DisableUACDescription	Eliminates repetitive administrator approval prompts when installing software or running admin tools, making power-user workflows much smoother. Trade-off: programs run without an elevation prompt (reduces protection if you accidentally launch malware); disable only if you know what you run.\nTakes effect after reboot.	取消安装软件和运行管理工具时反复弹出的管理员确认框，操作更顺畅无打断。代价是程序不再经手动弹窗拦截即可提权，存在误点恶意软件的风险，仅建议熟悉自身软件环境的用户开启。\n重启生效。
DisableWarningForOpeningDownloadedFilesName	Disable "Open File – Security Warning" for downloads	取消打开下载文件时的安全警告
DisableWarningForOpeningDownloadedFilesDescription	Removes the repetitive "Do you want to run this file?" confirmation prompt on files downloaded from the internet, saving clicks and startup delay. Does not disable browser download checks or antivirus scanning.\nEffective immediately.	取消每次打开网上下载的可执行文件时反复弹出的“是否运行此文件”确认框，省去多余点击。不影响浏览器下载检查和杀毒扫描。\n立即生效。
ShowKeyboardAccessKeyUnderlinesName	Always show keyboard access key underlines	始终显示菜单快捷键下划线（Alt 提示）
ShowKeyboardAccessKeyUnderlinesDescription	Keeps Alt+key shortcut underlines visible in menus and dialogs so keyboard navigation is faster without pressing Alt first. Purely visual, with zero performance cost.\nTakes effect after reboot.	在菜单和对话框中直接显示 Alt+字母快捷键的下划线提示，无需先按 Alt 就能看清快捷键，纯界面偏好且零性能开销。\n重启生效。
DisableTaskbarAndWindowTransparencyName	Disable taskbar and window transparency	关闭任务栏和窗口半透明效果
DisableTaskbarAndWindowTransparencyDescription	Turns off Acrylic/Mica blur compositing on the taskbar, Start menu, and windows, lowering GPU usage and making window movement snappier (especially on integrated graphics or remote desktop). Only trades translucent glass styling for clean solid colors.\nEffective immediately.	关闭任务栏、开始菜单和窗口的亚克力/云母模糊渲染，可降低 GPU 合成开销、让窗口拖动和远程桌面更流畅。代价仅是界面由半透明变为纯色，观感反而更清晰。\n立即生效。
ShowFileExtensionsName	Show file extensions	显示文件扩展名
ShowFileExtensionsDescription	Displays full file suffixes (like .exe, .pdf, .zip) in File Explorer so you can easily tell file types apart and spot disguised executables (e.g. invoice.pdf.exe). Practically zero downside.\nEffective immediately.	在文件资源管理器中完整显示 .exe、.pdf、.zip 等后缀名，既方便识别和修改文件类型，也能一眼识破伪装成文档的木马（如“简历.pdf.exe”），几乎零代价。\n立即生效。
ReduceMenuDelayName	Reduce menu open delay	降低菜单展开延迟
ReduceMenuDelayDescription	Cuts the built-in wait time before submenus open from 400 ms to 100 ms so the desktop feels noticeably snappier, while keeping smooth animations intact. Zero performance cost.\nTakes effect at next sign-in.	将子菜单展开前的默认等待时间从 400 ms 缩短到 100 ms，让右键和多级菜单明显更跟手，同时保留动画不显生硬，零性能代价。\n下次登录生效。
ReduceMouseHoverTimeName	Reduce mouse hover delay	降低鼠标悬停响应延迟
ReduceMouseHoverTimeDescription	Shortens the wait before tooltips and hover previews appear from 400 ms to 100 ms, making desktop interactions feel quicker. Easily reversible if you prefer a longer pause.\nTakes effect at next sign-in.	将工具提示和悬停预览的触发延迟从 400 ms 缩短到 100 ms，鼠标交互更利落；若觉得触发太快可随时取消。\n下次登录生效。
DisplayThisPCWhenOpeningFileExplorerName	Open File Explorer to "This PC"	打开文件资源管理器时直接显示“此电脑”
DisplayThisPCWhenOpeningFileExplorerDescription	Jumps straight to your drives and folders instead of the cluttered Home/Quick Access view, saving clicks and avoiding slow loading of recent/cloud file lists. Quick Access is still available in the left sidebar.\nEffective immediately.	打开资源管理器直接进入磁盘分区列表，免去主页/快速访问加载最近文件和云端记录的拖慢，左侧栏仍随时可点回快速访问。\n立即生效。
DoNotAddShortcutTextWhenCreatingShortcutsName	Do not add "- Shortcut" suffix to new shortcuts	创建快捷方式时不添加“- 快捷方式”后缀
DoNotAddShortcutTextWhenCreatingShortcutsDescription	Keeps newly created shortcut names clean without manually renaming them every time. Shortcut icons still show the standard arrow badge so they remain easy to identify.\nEffective immediately.	新建快捷方式时不再自动追加冗长的“- 快捷方式”文字，省去每次手动重命名；图标左下角仍保留标准箭头标识，完全不会混淆。\n立即生效。
PreventSnapLayoutsFromShowingWhenDraggingWindowsToTheTopOfTheScreenName	Disable Snap Layouts bar at top of screen	拖动窗口到屏幕顶部时不弹出贴靠布局
PreventSnapLayoutsFromShowingWhenDraggingWindowsToTheTopOfTheScreenDescription	Stops the Snap Layouts flyout from popping up accidentally and causing drag stutter when moving windows near the top edge. You can still use Snap Layouts via Win+Z or by hovering over the Maximize button.\nTakes effect after restarting Explorer.	避免把窗口拖到屏幕顶部最大化时误触弹出贴靠布局或引发拖动卡顿。仍可通过 Win+Z 或鼠标悬停在最大化按钮上随时使用分屏布局。\n重启资源管理器生效。
DisableSnapAssistName	Disable Snap Assist	禁用贴靠助手（分屏后推荐其他窗口）
DisableSnapAssistDescription	Stops Windows from showing thumbnails of other open windows after you snap one to a screen edge, eliminating visual clutter and interruption. Edge and corner window snapping itself keeps working normally.\nTakes effect after restarting Explorer.	窗口贴靠到屏幕边缘后不再弹出其余窗口的缩略图列表，减少视觉打断；拖动到屏幕边缘和角落自动分屏的功能本身完全保留。\n重启资源管理器生效。
DisablePreviewHandlersName	Disable File Explorer preview handlers	禁用文件资源管理器预览处理器
DisablePreviewHandlersDescription	Stops File Explorer from loading third-party document, PDF, and email previewers inside the preview pane, preventing slow folder browsing, crashes, and "file in use" locks. Normal image thumbnails still work.\nTakes effect after restarting Explorer.	停止在资源管理器预览窗格中加载 PDF、Office、邮件等第三方预览插件，可避免浏览文件夹卡顿、崩溃和“文件被占用无法删除”的问题；普通图片缩略图不受影响。\n重启资源管理器生效。
TurnOffSearchHighlightsName	Turn off taskbar Search Highlights	关闭任务栏搜索热点图标
TurnOffSearchHighlightsDescription	Removes the daily doodle and trending news cards from the taskbar search box, cutting visual distraction and online fetches. Local search keeps working identically.\nEffective immediately.	移除任务栏搜索栏右侧的每日热点图标与网络热搜卡片，界面更清爽并减少联网拉取，不影响正常搜索功能。\n立即生效。
TurnOffWidgetsName	Turn off Widgets	关闭任务栏小组件
TurnOffWidgetsDescription	Disables the news/weather Widgets panel and its background WebView2 processes, freeing RAM and stopping accidental hover popups. Does not affect any other taskbar feature.\nEffective immediately.	关闭任务栏左侧的资讯/天气小组件及其后台 WebView2 进程，节省内存并避免鼠标滑过误弹出，不影响其他任务栏功能。\n立即生效。
HideTheSearchBoxName	Hide taskbar search box	隐藏任务栏搜索框
HideTheSearchBoxDescription	Reclaims substantial taskbar space for open app windows. Searching is still just as fast—press the Win key and start typing directly in the Start menu.\nTakes effect after restarting Explorer.	释放任务栏大片空间以显示更多应用窗口。想搜索时直接按 Win 键打字即可，效率完全不变。\n重启资源管理器生效。
HideTaskViewButtonName	Hide Task View button	隐藏任务栏“任务视图”按钮
HideTaskViewButtonDescription	Frees up taskbar space by hiding an extra icon that is rarely clicked. Task View and virtual desktops remain fully accessible anytime via Win+Tab.\nEffective immediately.	隐藏很少点击的多余图标以让任务栏更简洁；随时可按 Win+Tab 打开任务视图和虚拟桌面，功能无任何损失。\n立即生效。
NeverCombineTaskbarIconsName	Never combine taskbar buttons	从不合并任务栏图标
NeverCombineTaskbarIconsDescription	Shows each open window with its own title label on the taskbar so you can switch directly in one click instead of hovering through grouped previews. Only uses more horizontal taskbar width when many windows are open.\nTakes effect after restarting Explorer.	让同一软件的每个窗口都在任务栏单独展开并显示标题，一键直达目标窗口而不用反复悬停挑选。仅在同时开大量窗口时占用更多任务栏宽度。\n重启资源管理器生效。
PreventStartMenuFromSearchingTheWebName	Disable web search in Start menu	禁止开始菜单搜索网页
PreventStartMenuFromSearchingTheWebDescription	Stops Start menu searches from sending your keystrokes to Bing and showing slow web cards, making local app and file search noticeably faster and more private. You can still search the web in your browser as usual.\nTakes effect after restarting Explorer.	阻止开始菜单把搜索词发往 Bing 并加载网页卡片，让本机应用与设置搜索更快、结果更干净也更保护隐私，完全不影响正常上网。\n重启资源管理器生效。
PreventStartMenuFromSearchingCloudContentName	Disable cloud content in Windows Search	禁止 Windows 搜索拉取云端内容
PreventStartMenuFromSearchingCloudContentDescription	Stops local search from querying OneDrive, SharePoint, and Outlook cloud data, speeding up search results and reducing unnecessary network requests. Local search is unaffected.\nEffective immediately.	阻止搜索栏额外查询 OneDrive、SharePoint、Outlook 等云端内容，加快本机搜索响应并减少多余联网请求，不影响本地文件搜索。\n立即生效。
DisableRecommendedAppsName	Disable recommended apps in Start menu	禁用开始菜单推荐应用
DisableRecommendedAppsDescription	Removes promotional app recommendations and tips from the Start menu's Recommended area, keeping the layout clean with zero loss of functionality.\nEffective immediately.	移除开始菜单中微软推送的广告应用与推广提示，让开始菜单更清爽，不影响任何正常功能。\n立即生效。
DisableAutoPlayName	Disable AutoPlay for removable media	禁止 U 盘与光盘自动播放
DisableAutoPlayDescription	Prevents USB drives, memory cards, and discs from automatically launching actions on insertion, blocking a classic malware propagation vector and annoying popups. You can still open drives normally in File Explorer.\nEffective immediately.	插上 U 盘、存储卡或光盘时不再自动弹出操作或运行程序，既减少打扰又降低感染病毒风险；仍可在“此电脑”中正常打开设备。\n立即生效。
EnableWindowsDeliveryOptimizationName	Allow LAN peer sharing for Windows Updates	开启局域网 Windows 更新传递优化
EnableWindowsDeliveryOptimizationDescription	Allows Windows to fetch update chunks from other PCs on your own local network (LAN-only mode, not over the internet), speeding up updates when you have multiple PCs without using external upload bandwidth.\nEffective immediately.	允许从同一局域网内其他电脑获取系统更新片段（仅限内网，不对外网上传），多台电脑更新更快且不消耗公网上传带宽。\n立即生效。
NoAutoRebootAfterWindowsUpdateName	Prevent automatic reboot after Windows Update	Windows 更新后不自动重启
NoAutoRebootAfterWindowsUpdateDescription	Stops Windows from forcibly rebooting while you are signed in and losing unsaved work or interrupting 24/7 tasks. Updates still install cleanly whenever you choose to restart manually.\nEffective immediately.	只要当前有用户登录，Windows 安装更新后就不会强制自动重启，避免丢失未保存的工作或打断挂机任务；等你方便时手动重启即可完成更新。\n立即生效。
AllowEdgeToDownloadDangerousFileTypesWithoutWarningName	Allow Edge to download .exe/.msi/.crx without warning	允许 Edge 下载 .exe/.msi/.crx 时不弹出拦截警告
AllowEdgeToDownloadDangerousFileTypesWithoutWarningDescription	Stops Microsoft Edge from holding back common installers (.exe, .msi) and extensions (.crx) behind multi-step "Keep anyway" prompts, saving friction for developers and power users. Standard download checks for other threats stay intact; just confirm the download source yourself.\nEffective immediately.	让 Edge 下载常见的 .exe/.msi 安装包和 .crx 扩展时不再层层拦截、反复点击“保留”，大幅减少日常下载阻力；仅需自行确认下载来源可信。\n立即生效。
DoNotShowFrequentFoldersInFileExplorerName	Hide frequent folders in File Explorer	不在文件资源管理器中显示常用文件夹
DoNotShowFrequentFoldersInFileExplorerDescription	Stops File Explorer from automatically adding frequently visited folders to Quick Access, keeping the view clean and protecting privacy on shared screens. Folders you manually pin stay untouched.\nEffective immediately.	阻止资源管理器自动把常打开的目录塞进“快速访问”，界面更整洁且共享屏幕时更护隐私；你手动固定的文件夹不会受影响。\n立即生效。
DoNotShowRecentlyUsedFilesInFileExplorerName	Hide recent files in File Explorer	不在文件资源管理器中显示最近使用的文件
DoNotShowRecentlyUsedFilesInFileExplorerDescription	Hides the auto-generated recent files list in File Explorer so private documents aren't exposed when opening folders or sharing your screen, and reduces extra list loading. Files themselves are untouched.\nEffective immediately.	隐藏资源管理器自动记录的“最近使用的文件”列表，防止投屏或他人查看时暴露隐私文档并减少加载开销，不会删除任何文件。\n立即生效。
DoNotShowFilesFromOfficeComInFileExplorerName	Hide Office.com cloud files in File Explorer	不在文件资源管理器中显示 Office.com 云端文件
DoNotShowFilesFromOfficeComInFileExplorerDescription	Removes online Office.com / Microsoft 365 cloud file suggestions from File Explorer, keeping the view local-only, faster, and less cluttered. Your cloud files remain accessible in Office apps and browsers.\nEffective immediately.	隐藏资源管理器中穿插的 Office.com/Microsoft 365 云端文档记录，让视图专注本地文件、更清爽快捷；云端文档仍可在 Office 或网页端正常打开。\n立即生效。
DoNotShowNewlyInstalledAppsInTheStartMenuName	Hide recently added apps in Start menu	开始菜单不显示“最近添加”应用
DoNotShowNewlyInstalledAppsInTheStartMenuDescription	Removes the "Recently added" section at the top of the Start menu app list so newly installed utilities don't push down your regular list. All apps remain in the normal A–Z list and search.\nEffective immediately.	关闭开始菜单顶部的“最近添加”分组，减少视觉干扰；所有已装软件仍可从全部应用列表或搜索正常打开。\n立即生效。
DoNotShowFrequentlyUsedAppsInTheStartMenuName	Hide most used apps in Start menu	开始菜单不显示“最常用”应用
DoNotShowFrequentlyUsedAppsInTheStartMenuDescription	Hides the dynamically changing "Most used" app list in the Start menu, improving privacy and keeping the Start menu layout predictable. Pinned apps are unaffected.\nEffective immediately.	隐藏开始菜单自动统计的“最常用”应用列表，保护使用隐私且避免菜单布局频繁变动；你手动固定的应用不受影响。\n立即生效。
DisablePersonalizedAdsName	Disable Windows advertising ID	禁用 Windows 广告 ID 与个性化广告
DisablePersonalizedAdsDescription	Turns off the system advertising ID so apps cannot track your usage across apps to build ad profiles. Has zero negative impact on normal app functionality.\nEffective immediately.	关闭系统广告 ID，阻止应用跨软件追踪偏好并推送定向广告，对任何正常功能零影响。\n立即生效。
PreventWebsitesFromKnowingMyLanguageName	Do not share Windows language list with websites	禁止网站读取本机语言列表
PreventWebsitesFromKnowingMyLanguageDescription	Stops Windows from sharing your installed language list with websites for regional ad/content targeting, slightly reducing browser fingerprinting with no impact on normal browsing.\nEffective immediately.	阻止 Windows 向网站提供本机语言列表用于地域推广，减少额外隐私暴露，不影响正常浏览网页。\n立即生效。
AllowWindowsTrackingAppsILaunchName	Keep app launch tracking (for Run history)	保留应用启动跟踪（用于记住“运行”历史）
AllowWindowsTrackingAppsILaunchDescription	Keeps Windows' local launch history enabled so the Win+R Run dialog remembers your previous commands and Start menu search stays responsive. Stored locally only, with negligible overhead.\nEffective immediately.	保留本机应用启动记录，否则 Win+R“运行”对话框会丢失历史命令记忆。仅在本机生效，性能开销几乎为零。\n立即生效。
PreventWindowsFromTrackingFilesIOpenName	Stop tracking recently opened files	禁止 Windows 跟踪打开的文件记录
PreventWindowsFromTrackingFilesIOpenDescription	Stops Windows from recording opened documents for Jump Lists and Start/Explorer recent lists, improving privacy when others use or view your screen. Only removes automatic "Recent" jump list history.\nEffective immediately.	禁止 Windows 记录你打开过的文档历史（如任务栏跳转列表和开始菜单最近项目），更保护隐私；代价仅是不再自动生成“最近打开”历史列表。\n立即生效。
PreventWindowsFromTrackingMySystemSettingsName	Disable suggested content in Settings	禁用“设置”应用中的推荐内容
PreventWindowsFromTrackingMySystemSettingsDescription	Turns off promotional cards and feature suggestions inside the Windows Settings app, keeping Settings cleaner without removing any actual settings.\nEffective immediately.	关闭 Windows“设置”页面中穿插的推广卡片与功能建议，界面更干净，不会缺少任何系统设置项。\n立即生效。
DisableWindowsSpotlightName	Disable Windows Spotlight	禁用 Windows 聚焦
DisableWindowsSpotlightDescription	Stops Windows from downloading daily Bing wallpapers, lock-screen tips, and promotional links in the background, saving network/disk activity and removing desktop "Learn about this picture" icons. You can use any local wallpaper instead.\nEffective after group policy refresh.	停止后台自动下载每日聚焦壁纸、锁屏推广链接及桌面“了解此图片”图标，减少联网和界面杂项，可自由使用本地壁纸。\n刷新组策略后生效。
DisableMicrosoftConsumerFeaturesName	Disable Microsoft consumer promotions	禁用微软消费级推广功能
DisableMicrosoftConsumerFeaturesDescription	Blocks Windows from auto-installing promotional Store apps (like casual games or partner apps) and pushing Microsoft 365/account nagging tiles after updates. Keeps the system clean with zero impact on apps you install yourself.\nEffective after group policy refresh.	阻止系统更新后自动塞入推广游戏、合作应用及账号/会员推广磁贴，让系统保持纯净，不影响你自己从商店安装应用。\n刷新组策略后生效。
DisableSuggestedAppInstallationName	Disable silent suggested app installs	禁用推荐应用静默安装
DisableSuggestedAppInstallationDescription	Prevents Windows from quietly downloading and installing "suggested" third-party apps in the background for your user account, saving disk space and bandwidth with zero downside.\nEffective immediately.	阻止 Windows 在后台为当前账户静默下载并安装推荐的第三方应用，节省空间与流量，完全无副作用。\n立即生效。
DisableStartAndSettingsSuggestionsName	Disable Start, Settings, and welcome suggestions	禁用开始菜单、设置与欢迎体验推广建议
DisableStartAndSettingsSuggestionsDescription	Turns off promotional tips, third-party suggestions, and post-update welcome nags across Start and Settings. Eliminates popups and clutter without removing any system feature.\nEffective after group policy refresh.	关闭开始菜单、设置及更新后的各类提示、第三方推荐和欢迎引导弹窗，显著减少打扰且不影响任何正常功能。\n刷新组策略后生效。
UseClassicalContextMenuName	Use classic Windows 10 right-click menu	恢复 Win10 经典完整右键菜单
UseClassicalContextMenuDescription	Replaces Windows 11's collapsed right-click menu so all actions (7-Zip, Git, Notepad++, copy/paste) appear immediately without clicking "Show more options" every time. Slightly taller menu, far faster daily workflow.\nTakes effect after restarting Explorer.	跳过 Windows 11 的二级折叠右键菜单，一次右键直接显示压缩、Git、编辑器等全部选项，免去每次再点“显示更多选项”，日常效率高得多。\n重启资源管理器生效。
DisableVisualEffectDescription	Turns off this decorative UI animation or effect so the desktop responds more crisply with lower GPU/DWM compositing overhead. Purely visual, with zero functional downside.\nSome changes require signing out and back in.	关闭这项装饰性界面动画或特效，让桌面操作更干脆利落并降低 GPU/桌面合成开销。纯视觉精简，无任何功能损失。\n部分需要重新登录生效。
EnableVisualEffectDescription	Keeps this essential visual cue enabled when using custom visual effects so text stays sharp and windows remain easy to read and drag, at virtually zero performance cost.\nSome changes require signing out and back in.	在自定义精简视觉效果时保留这项关键显示效果，确保字体清晰、窗口层次分明且操作顺手，性能开销几乎为零。\n部分需要重新登录生效。
DisableClientAreaAnimationName	Disable animations inside windows	禁用窗口内控件和元素动画
DisableWindowAnimationName	Disable window minimize and maximize animations	禁用窗口最小化和最大化动画
DisableTaskbarAnimationName	Disable taskbar animations	禁用任务栏动画
DisableAeroPeekName	Disable Aero Peek	禁用 Aero Peek 桌面透视
DisableMenuAnimationName	Disable menu fade and slide animations	禁用菜单淡入淡出与滑动动画
DisableTooltipAnimationName	Disable tooltip fade and slide animations	禁用工具提示淡入淡出与滑动动画
DisableMenuFadeOutName	Disable menu fade-out after clicking	禁用点击后菜单淡出效果
DisableTaskbarThumbnailCacheName	Disable saving taskbar thumbnail previews	禁用保存任务栏缩略图预览缓存
EnableMousePointerShadowName	Keep mouse pointer shadow	保留鼠标指针阴影
EnableWindowShadowName	Keep shadows under windows	保留窗口阴影
EnableTranslucentSelectionRectangleName	Keep translucent selection rectangle	保留半透明框选矩形
EnableWindowContentWhileDraggingName	Keep window contents visible while dragging	拖动窗口时显示完整内容
DisableComboBoxAnimationName	Disable combo box slide-open animation	禁用下拉框滑动展开动画
EnableFontSmoothingName	Keep screen font edge smoothing	保留屏幕字体边缘平滑
DisableListBoxSmoothScrollingName	Disable list box smooth scrolling	禁用列表框平滑滚动
EnableDesktopIconLabelShadowName	Keep drop shadows for desktop icon labels	保留桌面图标文字阴影
WindowsActivatorName	Activate Windows	激活 Windows
WindowsActivatorDescription	Activates Windows so personalization settings work normally and activation watermarks/restrictions are removed.\nEffective immediately.	激活 Windows 以解锁个性化设置并消除未激活水印与功能限制。\n立即生效。
WindowsUpdateName	Enable Windows Update	启用 Windows 更新
WindowsUpdateDescription	Keeps Windows Update enabled so security patches, driver fixes, and stability improvements remain available when you want them. Pair with "Prevent automatic reboot" so updates won't interrupt your work.\nEffective immediately.	保持 Windows 更新服务可用，确保需要时能正常获取安全补丁、驱动和稳定性修复；搭配“更新后不自动重启”即可避免打断工作。\n立即生效。
EnableTimeSynchronizationName	Enable automatic time synchronization	开启自动时间同步
EnableTimeSynchronizationDescription	Keeps the system clock accurate via Windows Time (NTP), preventing HTTPS certificate errors, login failures, 2FA mismatches, and update issues. Uses virtually zero CPU or network bandwidth.\nEffective immediately.	通过 Windows 时间服务（NTP）保持系统时钟准确，避免因时间偏差引发网页证书报错、登录失败、两步验证不匹配和更新异常，资源占用几乎为零。\n立即生效。
BestPerformancePowerModeName	Best performance power mode	最佳性能电源模式
BestPerformancePowerModeDescription	Prioritizes CPU performance and responsiveness when plugged in and avoids big-little core scheduling issues. Only changes plugged-in (AC) behavior so battery life is unaffected; the CPU still scales down when idle without noticeable extra heat or fan noise.\nEffective immediately.	插电时优先保证 CPU 性能释放和响应速度，并避免大小核调度异常。仅修改插电（AC）设置，不影响使用电池时的续航；空闲时 CPU 仍会自动降频节能，不会明显增加日常发热或噪音。\n立即生效。
DisablePcieAspmName	Disable PCIe Link State Power Management (ASPM)	关闭 PCIe 链接状态电源管理（ASPM）
DisablePcieAspmDescription	PCIe ASPM is mainly meant for laptop battery life. Disabling it when plugged in improves stability and lowers latency, helping prevent random NIC drops, high DPC latency, and GPU/NVMe wake glitches. Trade-off: only about 1–3W more idle power with negligible heat, and battery (DC) settings stay untouched.\nEffective immediately.	PCIe ASPM 本是给笔记本省电用的，插电关闭后可显著提升稳定性、降低响应延迟，减少网卡随机断链、高 DPC 延迟以及显卡/NVMe 休眠唤醒黑屏或卡顿。代价仅为待机多耗约 1~3W，发热几乎无感，且仅插电生效、不影响电池续航。\n立即生效。
DisableUsbPowerSavingName	Disable USB Selective Suspend and USB 3 link power saving	关闭 USB 选择性暂停与 USB 3 链路省电
DisableUsbPowerSavingDescription	Prevents Windows from suspending USB ports and USB 3 links (U1/U2), helping eliminate USB DAC/audio crackles and dropouts, wireless mouse/keyboard wake lag, and dock, capture card, or external drive disconnects. Trade-off: virtually zero extra power draw, and battery (DC) settings stay untouched.\nEffective immediately.	避免 Windows 自动休眠 USB 端口和 USB 3 链路，可有效解决 USB 声卡/DAC 爆音掉线、无线键鼠唤醒迟钝、扩展坞/采集卡/外置硬盘莫名重连等问题。关闭后功耗增加几乎为零，且仅插电生效、不影响电池续航。\n立即生效。
DisableAhciLinkPowerManagementName	Disable AHCI/SATA link power management (HIPM/DIPM)	关闭 AHCI/SATA 链路电源管理（HIPM/DIPM）
DisableAhciLinkPowerManagementDescription	Keeps SATA links active instead of entering Partial/Slumber sleep states, preventing wake timeouts, I/O stalls, and brief system freezes. Trade-off: under 1W extra power with no noticeable heat, and battery (DC) settings stay untouched.\nEffective immediately.	让 SATA 硬盘和光驱保持链路就绪而不进入低功耗休眠，避免唤醒超时导致的系统短暂假死或读写卡顿。额外功耗不到 1W、几乎无发热变化，且仅插电生效、不影响电池续航。\n立即生效。
DisableNvmeDeepPowerSavingName	Disable NVMe deep non-operational power states	禁止 NVMe 进入深度非运行省电状态
DisableNvmeDeepPowerSavingDescription	Keeps NVMe SSDs out of deep sleep states (PS3/PS4), reducing light-load wake latency spikes and lowering the risk of drive resets or disconnects. Trade-off: about 1W extra idle power and a slight temperature rise (safe with normal airflow), and battery (DC) settings stay untouched.\nEffective immediately.	阻止 NVMe 固态硬盘频繁进出深度休眠（PS3/PS4），可减少轻负载下的读写唤醒延迟抖动，并降低部分盘偶发掉盘或复位（Event 129）的风险。待机功耗仅多约 1W、温度略升几度（正常风道下完全安全），且仅插电生效、不影响电池续航。\n立即生效。
DisableWirelessPowerSavingName	Set wireless adapter power saving to maximum performance	无线网卡节能模式设为最高性能
DisableWirelessPowerSavingDescription	Keeps Wi-Fi at Maximum Performance instead of power-saving polling when plugged in, reducing periodic ping spikes, packet loss, and wake disconnects. Trade-off: under 1W extra power, and battery (DC) settings stay untouched.\nEffective immediately.	插电时让 Wi-Fi 保持最高性能而不进入节能轮询，可减少游戏、远程桌面和 SSH 时的周期性延迟抖动、丢包及唤醒断网。额外功耗不到 1W，且仅插电生效、不影响电池续航。\n立即生效。
DisableEthernetPowerSavingName	Disable wired Ethernet power saving (EEE and device sleep)	关闭有线网卡节能（EEE 与系统休眠断电）
DisableEthernetPowerSavingDescription	Turns off Energy-Efficient Ethernet (EEE), vendor green power modes, and “Allow the computer to turn off this device to save power” on physical wired NICs, helping prevent random link drops, speed downgrades, and wake disconnects. Trade-off: typically under 0.5W extra power with no noticeable impact.\nTakes effect after reboot (or after re-enabling the adapter).	关闭物理有线网卡的节能以太网（EEE）及“允许系统关闭设备省电”，可有效避免 Intel/Realtek 等网卡随机断链、协商降速（如万兆降千兆、千兆降百兆）或休眠后断网。关闭后额外功耗通常不到 0.5W，几乎无感。\n重启（或重新启用网卡）后生效。
DisableDiskIdleName	Do not turn off hard disks when idle	禁止硬盘空闲自动关闭
DisableDiskIdleDescription	Prevents drives from spinning down when idle while plugged in. Eliminates 3–5 second Explorer pauses waiting for HDD spin-up and avoids excessive start/stop wear from background wakes on 24/7 PCs (harmless on SSDs). Trade-off: roughly 4–6W per spinning HDD plus light hum; battery (DC) settings stay untouched. Leave unchecked if you want cold-storage HDDs to spin down for silence.\nEffective immediately.	插电时不让硬盘空闲自动停转，可避免打开文件或资源管理器时整机卡住 3~5 秒等机械盘起转；对 7×24 小时开机也更护盘，避免后台频繁唤醒导致机械盘反复启停损耗（对 SSD 无影响）。代价为每块常转机械盘约 4~6W 且持续微弱运转声；仅插电生效、不影响电池续航，若有纯冷数据盘需停转静音可不勾选。\n立即生效。
SetIdleTimeName	Prevent automatic sleep and hibernation when plugged in	插电时禁止电脑自动睡眠与休眠
SetIdleTimeDescription	Keeps the PC awake for downloads, remote desktop, builds, and 24/7 tasks when plugged in without changing the screen-off timeout. Only changes plugged-in (AC) settings so battery auto-sleep stays intact.\nEffective immediately.	插电时避免电脑自动睡眠或休眠，确保远程桌面、下载、编译和挂机任务不被中断；不改变自动息屏时间，且不影响使用电池时的自动省电。\n立即生效。
DisableSystemSoundsName	Disable Windows system sounds	关闭 Windows 系统提示音
DisableSystemSoundsDescription	Silences Windows notification chimes, error dings, and popups so your audio stays distraction-free. Does not mute music, games, videos, or app audio.\nEffective immediately.	静音系统各类弹窗叮咚声与错误提示音，避免打断听歌、开会或工作；不影响音乐、视频、游戏等任何应用声音。\n立即生效。
DisableEdgeFromRunningInBackgroundName	Prevent Edge from running in the background	禁止 Edge 浏览器在后台驻留
DisableEdgeFromRunningInBackgroundDescription	Turns off Edge prelaunch, Startup Boost, and background extensions so closing Edge actually frees its RAM and CPU. Launching Edge only takes a fraction of a second longer.\nEffective after group policy refresh.	关闭 Edge 预启动、启动增强和后台模式，关掉浏览器后真正释放内存和 CPU；再次打开仅慢零点几秒，完全可接受。\n刷新组策略后生效。
TurnOnGameModeName	Enable Windows Game Mode	开启 Windows 游戏模式
TurnOnGameModeDescription	Tells Windows to pause update restarts and suppress background notifications while gaming for steadier frame pacing. Zero impact when you are not playing games.\nEffective immediately.	游戏时自动抑制系统更新重启与后台通知干扰，让帧率表现更稳定；平时不玩游戏时零开销、无任何副作用。\n立即生效。
DisableGameDvrCaptureName	Disable Game DVR background recording	禁用 Game DVR 后台录屏
DisableGameDvrCaptureDescription	Turns off Xbox Game Bar's background video capture to eliminate hidden GPU encoder, RAM, and disk I/O overhead during games and 3D apps. Keeps Game Mode enabled; only needed if you rely on built-in Xbox clip recording.\nEffective after group policy refresh.	关闭 Xbox Game Bar 的游戏录制与后台片段捕获，避免默默占用 GPU 编码器、内存和磁盘读写。不影响游戏模式，不使用内置录屏可放心关闭。\n刷新组策略后生效。
ShowThumbnailsName	Show image thumbnails in File Explorer	在文件资源管理器中显示图片缩略图
ShowThumbnailsDescription	Displays image and media previews directly on file icons so browsing photos and assets is much faster, with negligible overhead on modern SSDs.\nEffective immediately.	浏览文件夹时直接预览图片与媒体缩略图，找图选图效率高得多；在现代 SSD 上缓存开销极低。\n立即生效。
KingsoftAntivirusName	Uninstall Kingsoft Antivirus	卸载金山毒霸
KingsoftAntivirusDescription	Detected by known drivers or services. Third-party antivirus hooks every file read/write and network packet, noticeably slowing the PC and adding popups; Windows Defender already covers baseline protection.	通过已知驱动或服务检测。第三方杀毒会拦截每次文件读写和网络访问，明显拖慢系统并增加弹窗；卸载后系统自带安全能力仍可兜底。
HuoRongSecurityName	Uninstall HuoRong Security	卸载火绒安全
HuoRongSecurityDescription	Detected by known drivers or services. Third-party file-system filter drivers add overhead to every file I/O, compile, and app launch; remove if you want maximum I/O speed.	通过已知驱动或服务检测。第三方文件过滤驱动会给每次文件读写、编译和软件启动带来额外开销；追求极致磁盘和响应速度可卸载。
360AntivirusName	Uninstall 360 Security / Antivirus	卸载 360 安全卫士/杀毒
360AntivirusDescription	Detected by known drivers or services. Heavy kernel hooks, background scans, and frequent popups noticeably slow down disk I/O and startup; Windows Defender already covers baseline protection.	通过已知驱动或服务检测。常驻内核拦截、后台扫描与弹窗会明显拖慢磁盘 I/O 和开机速度；卸载后系统更清爽流畅。
DASEDRName	Uninstall DAS EDR	卸载明御终端安全及防病毒系统
DASEDRDescription	Detected by known drivers or services. Enterprise EDR hooks file and process activity continuously, causing heavy CPU and disk overhead. Check company policy before removing on a managed work PC.	通过已知驱动或服务检测。企业 EDR 会持续拦截文件与进程活动，显著占用 CPU 和磁盘；若为公司受管电脑，卸载前请确认合规要求。
RisingAntivirusName	Uninstall Rising Antivirus	卸载瑞星杀毒
RisingAntivirusDescription	Detected by known drivers or services. Third-party antivirus hooks every file read/write and noticeably slows app launches and builds; Windows Defender already covers baseline protection.	通过已知驱动或服务检测。第三方杀毒会拦截每次文件读写，明显拖慢应用启动与编译；卸载后可显著恢复响应速度。
TencentPCManagerName	Uninstall Tencent PC Manager	卸载腾讯电脑管家
TencentPCManagerDescription	Detected by known drivers or services. Background services, filter drivers, and promotional popups consume CPU/RAM and slow file I/O; uninstalling makes the system cleaner and faster.	通过已知驱动或服务检测。后台常驻服务、驱动拦截与弹窗会持续占用资源并拖慢文件读写，卸载后系统明显更轻快。
KasperskyAntivirusName	Uninstall Kaspersky	卸载卡巴斯基
KasperskyAntivirusDescription	Detected by known drivers or services. Deep file and HTTPS inspection noticeably slows file I/O, installs, and builds; remove if you prefer maximum performance over third-party AV.	通过已知驱动或服务检测。深度文件与 HTTPS 扫描会明显拖慢文件读写、安装和编译速度；如追求性能可按需卸载。
AvastAntivirusName	Uninstall Avast	卸载 Avast
AvastAntivirusDescription	Detected by known drivers or services. Real-time shields and upsell prompts add noticeable CPU/disk overhead; Windows Defender already provides lightweight baseline protection.	通过已知驱动或服务检测。实时防护与推广弹窗会增加明显的 CPU 和磁盘开销；卸载后系统更轻快干净。
AvgAntivirusName	Uninstall AVG	卸载 AVG
AvgAntivirusDescription	Detected by known drivers or services. Background shields and popups add noticeable CPU and disk I/O overhead; Windows Defender already covers baseline protection.	通过已知驱动或服务检测。后台拦截与推广弹窗会增加明显的 CPU 与磁盘开销；卸载后可明显改善流畅度。
BitdefenderAntivirusName	Uninstall Bitdefender	卸载 Bitdefender
BitdefenderAntivirusDescription	Detected by known drivers or services. Heavy real-time scanning consumes substantial RAM and slows file I/O and builds; remove if you prioritize responsiveness.	通过已知驱动或服务检测。高强度实时扫描会占用较多内存并拖慢文件读写与编译；如更看重响应速度可按需卸载。
EsetAntivirusName	Uninstall ESET	卸载 ESET
EsetAntivirusDescription	Detected by known drivers or services. Third-party file-system filter drivers add overhead to every file access and compile; remove if you want maximum I/O throughput.	通过已知驱动或服务检测。第三方文件过滤驱动会给每次文件访问与编译带来额外开销；追求极致 I/O 性能可按需卸载。
McAfeeAntivirusName	Uninstall McAfee	卸载 McAfee
McAfeeAntivirusDescription	Detected by known drivers or services. Frequently preinstalled bloatware that slows file access and pushes subscription popups; uninstalling immediately improves speed and cleanliness.	通过已知驱动或服务检测。常见预装软件，会拖慢文件读写并频繁弹出续费广告，卸载后流畅度立竿见影。
NortonAntivirusName	Uninstall Norton	卸载诺顿
NortonAntivirusDescription	Detected by known drivers or services. Heavy background services and upsell notifications slow down startup and disk I/O; uninstalling frees resources with no loss of system features.	通过已知驱动或服务检测。较重的后台服务与推广提醒会拖慢开机和磁盘读写，卸载后可明显释放系统资源。
MalwarebytesAntivirusName	Uninstall Malwarebytes	卸载 Malwarebytes
MalwarebytesAntivirusDescription	Detected by known drivers or services. Real-time protection hooks add ongoing CPU, RAM, and file I/O overhead; remove if you only need occasional on-demand checks.	通过已知驱动或服务检测。常驻实时拦截会持续占用 CPU、内存与磁盘 I/O；不需要常驻时卸载可释放资源。
TrendMicroAntivirusName	Uninstall Trend Micro	卸载趋势科技
TrendMicroAntivirusDescription	Detected by known drivers or services. Real-time monitoring drivers noticeably slow file access and app startup; uninstalling improves responsiveness.	通过已知驱动或服务检测。实时监控驱动会明显拖慢文件访问和应用启动，卸载后可恢复系统流畅度。
AviraAntivirusName	Uninstall Avira	卸载 Avira
AviraAntivirusDescription	Detected by known drivers or services. Background guards and promotional popups consume resources and slow file I/O; uninstalling keeps Windows cleaner and snappier.	通过已知驱动或服务检测。后台监控和推广弹窗会占用资源并拖慢文件访问，卸载后系统更干净流畅。
Security2345Name	Uninstall 2345 Security	卸载 2345 安全卫士
Security2345Description	Detected by known drivers or services. Heavy background hooks and ad popups noticeably degrade performance and user experience; strongly recommended to remove.	通过已知驱动或服务检测。后台驻留拦截与弹窗广告会严重影响系统性能和使用体验，强烈建议卸载。
BaiduAntivirusName	Uninstall Baidu Antivirus / Guard	卸载百度杀毒/卫士
BaiduAntivirusDescription	Detected by known drivers or services. Legacy filter drivers and background services slow file I/O and offer little value on modern Windows; safe to remove.	通过已知驱动或服务检测。老旧过滤驱动与后台服务会拖慢文件读写且在现代系统上意义不大，建议卸载。
QiAnXinTianqingName	Uninstall QiAnXin Tianqing	卸载奇安信天擎
QiAnXinTianqingDescription	Detected by known drivers or services. Enterprise endpoint security hooks file and network activity heavily, noticeably slowing the PC. Check company policy before removing on a managed work PC.	通过已知驱动或服务检测。企业终端安全会深度拦截文件和网络活动，明显拖慢性能；若为公司受管电脑，卸载前请确认合规要求。
UseWindowsTerminalName	Use Windows Terminal as default console	将 Windows Terminal 设为默认终端
UseWindowsTerminalDescription	Replaces the legacy Console Host with Microsoft's modern GPU-accelerated Windows Terminal supporting tabs, UTF-8, smooth scrolling, and themes. Fully compatible with cmd and PowerShell with practically zero downside.\nEffective immediately.	用微软现代 GPU 加速的 Windows Terminal 替代老旧控制台，支持多标签、UTF-8、流畅滚动与配色，完全兼容 cmd/PowerShell，几乎零代价。\n立即生效。
WindowsTerminalUseNewWindowName	Open Windows Terminal in a new window by default	打开 Windows Terminal 时默认新建窗口
WindowsTerminalUseNewWindowDescription	Opens each launch in its own window instead of silently attaching a tab to an existing window on another desktop or monitor, preventing focus surprises and script interference. You can still open tabs inside any window with Ctrl+Shift+T.\nEffective immediately.	每次启动都打开独立新窗口，避免标签页跑到其他显示器或虚拟桌面的旧窗口里引发误操作；窗口内仍可随时按 Ctrl+Shift+T 新建标签。\n立即生效。
YunTianEDRName	Uninstall YunTian EDR	卸载云天 EDR
YunTianEDRDescription	Detected by known drivers or services. Enterprise EDR hooks file and process activity continuously, causing heavy CPU and disk overhead. Check company policy before removing on a managed work PC.	通过已知驱动或服务检测。企业 EDR 会持续拦截文件与进程活动，显著占用 CPU 和磁盘；若为公司受管电脑，卸载前请确认合规要求。
TortoiseSVNCacheTypeName	Use simple status cache in TortoiseSVN	TortoiseSVN 改用简单状态缓存
TortoiseSVNCacheTypeDescription	Switches TortoiseSVN from the heavy background TSVNCache daemon to Shell cache, preventing constant CPU/disk thrashing and folder locks in large repositories. Trade-off: parent folders only update their overlay badge when opened (usually unnoticeable).\nEffective immediately.	将 TortoiseSVN 切换为轻量 Shell 缓存，避免 TSVNCache 在大仓库里持续狂扫磁盘、占满 CPU 或锁死目录。代价仅是上级目录的图标角标不会递归实时刷新，通常几乎无感。\n立即生效。
TortoiseGitCacheTypeName	Use simple status cache in TortoiseGit	TortoiseGit 改用简单状态缓存
TortoiseGitCacheTypeDescription	Switches TortoiseGit from the heavy background TGitCache daemon to Shell cache, stopping high CPU/disk usage and locked .git folders in large repos. Trade-off: parent folder badges only refresh on open, which is a tiny price for smooth disk I/O.\nEffective immediately.	将 TortoiseGit 切换为轻量 Shell 缓存，避免 TGitCache 在大仓库里高占 CPU/磁盘或锁住目录。代价仅是上级目录状态角标打开时才刷新，换来流畅体验完全值得。\n立即生效。
DisableRemoteDesktopSecurityWarningName	Disable Remote Desktop security warning	禁用远程桌面连接安全警告
DisableRemoteDesktopSecurityWarningDescription	Skips the repetitive resource-redirection warning dialog when connecting via mstsc to your own servers or PCs, saving clicks every session. Only connect to trusted machines.\nEffective immediately.	使用 mstsc 连接自己的电脑或服务器时，跳过每次重复弹出的资源重定向警告框，省去多余点击（连接信任的主机即可）。\n立即生效。
DisableTelemetryName	Minimize Windows telemetry and diagnostic data	最小化 Windows 遥测与诊断数据收集
DisableTelemetryDescription	Sets Windows diagnostic reporting to the minimum allowed level, cutting background data collection and upload to Microsoft with no impact on normal apps or Windows Update.\nEffective immediately.	将系统诊断数据上报降至最低级别，减少后台采集与上传微软的数据量，不影响正常应用和系统更新。\n立即生效。
DisablePowerShell7TelemetryName	Disable PowerShell 7 telemetry	禁用 PowerShell 7 遥测
DisablePowerShell7TelemetryDescription	Sets POWERSHELL_TELEMETRY_OPTOUT=1 so PowerShell 7 stops sending usage telemetry to Microsoft. Zero effect on PowerShell scripts or features.\nEffective for new PowerShell 7 processes.	通过环境变量 POWERSHELL_TELEMETRY_OPTOUT=1 阻止 PowerShell 7 向微软发送使用遥测，对脚本和功能完全零影响。\n对新启动的 PowerShell 7 进程生效。
DisableActivityHistoryName	Disable Windows Activity History	禁用 Windows 活动历史记录
DisableActivityHistoryDescription	Stops Windows from logging your opened apps/files and syncing them to Microsoft servers, improving privacy and removing unnecessary background tracking with zero daily downside.\nEffective immediately.	禁止 Windows 记录你使用过的应用与文件并同步至微软云端，提升隐私并减少后台记录，对日常使用几乎无影响。\n立即生效。
DisableFeedbackPromptsName	Disable Windows feedback prompts	禁用 Windows 反馈提示
DisableFeedbackPromptsDescription	Silences periodic "How satisfied are you with Windows?" surveys and feedback popups, eliminating interruptions with zero functional downside.\nEffective immediately.	关闭系统不定期弹出的满意度调查与反馈请求通知，彻底免打扰且无任何副作用。\n立即生效。
DisableConnectedUserExperiencesAndTelemetryServiceName	Disable Connected User Experiences and Telemetry service	禁用遥测与诊断跟踪服务（DiagTrack）
DisableConnectedUserExperiencesAndTelemetryServiceDescription	Stops the DiagTrack service from collecting and uploading telemetry in the background, reducing background disk/network activity. Only affects Feedback Hub and Windows Insider preview enrollment.\nEffective immediately.	停用 DiagTrack 后台遥测采集与上传服务，减少后台磁盘和联网活动。仅会影响“反馈中心”和加入 Windows 预览体验计划，绝大多数用户完全用不到。\n立即生效。
DisableWindowsErrorReportingServiceName	Disable Windows Error Reporting service	禁用 Windows 错误报告服务
DisableWindowsErrorReportingServiceDescription	Stops Windows from packaging and uploading application crash reports to Microsoft after a crash, saving disk/network activity and avoiding "Checking for a solution" waits. Local crash logs still work.\nEffective immediately.	停止在程序崩溃后打包上传错误报告至微软，省去“正在查找解决方案”的无意义等待和后台上传；本地事件日志仍正常记录。\n立即生效。
Tools	Tools	工具
ToolsDescription	Curated diagnostic, system repair, network troubleshooting, and maintenance shortcuts for everyday use.	精选的随包诊断工具与系统快捷入口，用于故障排查、网络修复、磁盘检查与日常维护。
Other	Other	其他
Storage	Storage	存储
Network	Network	网络
RunTool	Run	运行
ToolFailed	Failed to run tool.	运行工具失败。
ToolNotFound	Tool file not found: {0}	找不到工具文件：{0}
CrystalDiskInfoName	CrystalDiskInfo	CrystalDiskInfo（硬盘健康检测）
CrystalDiskInfoDescription	Inspect drive SMART health, temperature, bad sectors, and power-on hours to catch failing SSDs or HDDs early. Read-only and completely safe.	查看硬盘 SMART 健康度、温度、坏道与通电时长，提前发现故障隐患。纯只读检测，安全无风险。
CrystalDiskMarkName	CrystalDiskMark	CrystalDiskMark（磁盘测速）
CrystalDiskMarkDescription	Benchmark sequential and random read/write speeds to verify SSD performance or diagnose slow storage bottlenecks.	测试磁盘顺序与随机读写速度，用于检验 SSD 真实性能或排查存储变慢原因。
GeekUninstallerName	Geek Uninstaller	Geek Uninstaller（彻底卸载软件）
GeekUninstallerDescription	Uninstall desktop software cleanly and scan leftover files and registry entries missed by normal uninstallers.	卸载桌面软件并深度扫描普通卸载残留的文件与注册表项，保持系统干净。
HotkeyDetectiveName	Hotkey Detective	Hotkey Detective（快捷键冲突检测）
HotkeyDetectiveDescription	Press any shortcut to find out which background app hijacked that global hotkey.	按下任意快捷键即可查出是哪个后台程序抢占了全局热键，快速解决快捷键失效。
AutorunsName	Autoruns	Autoruns（全面启动项分析）
AutorunsDescription	Microsoft Sysinternals tool for inspecting every logon entry, service, driver, scheduled task, and shell extension in detail.	微软 Sysinternals 出品，可深度查看全部登录项、服务、驱动、计划任务与外壳扩展。
ProcessExplorerName	Process Explorer	Process Explorer（高级任务管理器）
ProcessExplorerDescription	Microsoft Sysinternals tool for inspecting process trees, loaded DLLs, file locks, and GPU/CPU usage to hunt down high load or locked files.	微软 Sysinternals 出品，可查看进程树、加载 DLL、文件占用句柄与详细资源开销，快速定位卡顿或文件被谁锁住。
SystemActivatorName	System activation	系统激活工具
SystemActivatorDescription	Launch the packaged Windows/Office activation helper.	运行随包的 Windows/Office 激活辅助工具。
TcpViewName	TCPView	TCPView（实时网络连接查看）
TcpViewDescription	Microsoft Sysinternals tool showing every active TCP/UDP connection and listening port by process—great for checking port conflicts or mystery traffic.	微软 Sysinternals 出品，按进程实时列出所有 TCP/UDP 连接和监听端口，方便排查端口占用或异常联网。
WinDirStatName	WinDirStat	WinDirStat（磁盘空间可视化分析）
WinDirStatDescription	Scan any drive and visualize folder sizes as a treemap so you can pinpoint huge files and forgotten folders at a glance.	扫描磁盘并用可视化色块呈现文件夹占用，一眼找出最占空间的“元凶”目录和大文件。
Repair	Repair	修复
ToolConfirmTitle	Confirm action	确认运行
ToolConfirmMessage	Run “{0}”? This action will modify system or network state.	确定要运行“{0}”吗？此操作会改动系统或网络状态。
RestartExplorerName	Restart File Explorer	重启文件资源管理器
RestartExplorerDescription	Safely restarts explorer.exe when the taskbar, desktop icons, or Explorer freeze, or to apply shell tweaks immediately. Does not close your other open apps.	当任务栏、桌面或资源管理器卡死，或需要立即生效界面设置时安全重启 explorer.exe，不会关闭其他运行中的软件。
RefreshIconCacheName	Rebuild icon & thumbnail cache	重建图标与缩略图缓存
RefreshIconCacheDescription	Clears and rebuilds Windows' icon and thumbnail databases to fix blank, broken, or outdated shortcut and file icons.	清理并重建系统图标与缩略图缓存，修复文件或快捷方式图标变白、错乱或不刷新的问题。
UpdateGroupPolicyName	Refresh Group Policy	刷新组策略（gpupdate）
UpdateGroupPolicyDescription	Runs gpupdate /force so recently changed policy-based optimizations take effect immediately without waiting.	执行 gpupdate /force，让刚修改的组策略类优化项立即生效，无需等待定时刷新。
ServiceManagerName	Services (services.msc)	服务管理器
ServiceManagerDescription	Open Windows Services to start, stop, or inspect startup types of background services.	打开 Windows 服务管理界面，查看、启停或调整各类后台服务的启动方式。
DeviceManagerName	Device Manager	设备管理器
DeviceManagerDescription	Inspect hardware devices, driver versions, exclamation errors, and power management tabs.	查看硬件状态、驱动版本、黄色感叹号报错及设备电源管理选项。
EventViewerName	Event Viewer	事件查看器
EventViewerDescription	Inspect Windows System and Application event logs to diagnose crashes, driver resets (e.g. Event 129), NIC drops, or service errors.	查看 Windows 系统与应用事件日志，排查蓝屏崩溃、硬盘复位、网卡断链或服务报错原因。
TaskSchedulerName	Task Scheduler	任务计划程序
TaskSchedulerDescription	View and manage scheduled tasks that auto-launch programs, wake the PC, or trigger periodic background scans.	查看并管理各类计划任务，排查定时弹窗、夜间自动唤醒或后台扫描任务。
EnvironmentVariablesName	Environment Variables	环境变量设置
EnvironmentVariablesDescription	Edit user and system environment variables (such as PATH) when CLI or development tools cannot be found.	编辑用户和系统环境变量（如 PATH），快速解决命令行或开发工具找不到的问题。
OptionalFeaturesSettingsName	Windows Optional Features	Windows 可选功能
OptionalFeaturesSettingsDescription	Enable or disable built-in Windows components such as Hyper-V, WSL, Sandbox, IIS, or SMB support.	开启或关闭 Hyper-V、WSL、Windows 沙盒、IIS、SMB 等系统自带可选组件。
ReliabilityMonitorName	Reliability Monitor	可靠性监视器
ReliabilityMonitorDescription	Shows a clean day-by-day timeline of app crashes, blue screens, and recent updates so you can quickly spot what broke stability.	按日期时间线直观汇总近期应用崩溃、蓝屏和更新安装记录，一眼定位系统变不稳前的改动。
ResourceMonitorName	Resource Monitor	资源监视器
ResourceMonitorDescription	Live per-process view of CPU, memory, disk I/O paths, and network traffic to diagnose spikes and bottlenecks.	实时细查各进程的 CPU、内存、具体磁盘读写文件路径和网络流量，精准定位卡顿源头。
FlushDnsName	Flush DNS cache	刷新 DNS 缓存
FlushDnsDescription	Clears the local DNS resolver cache to fix sites resolving to stale IPs or newly edited hosts entries not taking effect. Safe and instant.	清空本机 DNS 解析缓存，解决网页解析到旧 IP 或刚改的 hosts 不生效问题，安全无副作用。
NetworkConnectionsName	Network Connections	网络连接（网卡列表）
NetworkConnectionsDescription	Opens the classic ncpa.cpl adapter list to quickly enable/disable adapters, edit DNS/IP, or check link speed.	直接打开经典网卡管理窗口（ncpa.cpl），方便快速禁用/启用网卡、修改 IP/DNS 或查看协商速率。
WindowsFirewallSettingsName	Windows Firewall	Windows 防火墙设置
WindowsFirewallSettingsDescription	Check Windows Defender Firewall status and toggle Domain, Private, or Public network profiles.	查看 Windows 防火墙状态，并按域、专用或公用网络分别开启或关闭防火墙。
AllowAppsThroughFirewallName	Allow apps through Firewall	允许应用通过防火墙
AllowAppsThroughFirewallDescription	Choose which applications and services are permitted to accept incoming connections through Windows Firewall.	管理允许通过 Windows 防火墙通信的应用清单，解决局域网联机或本地服务被拦问题。
FirewallAdvancedSettingsName	Windows Firewall Advanced Security	高级安全 Windows 防火墙
FirewallAdvancedSettingsDescription	Configure granular inbound and outbound port/program rules when troubleshooting blocked services or locking down traffic.	精细管理入站与出站端口/程序规则，适合放行开发端口或排查连接被拦截。
ResetWinsockName	Reset Winsock	重置 Winsock 网络目录
ResetWinsockDescription	Repairs corrupted network socket layers left behind by uninstalled proxies, VPNs, or security filters. Takes effect after reboot.	修复代理、VPN 或安全过滤软件卸载残留导致的网络异常或打不开网页问题。重启后生效。
ResetTcpIpName	Reset TCP/IP stack	重置 TCP/IP 协议栈
ResetTcpIpDescription	Resets Windows' TCP/IP configuration to defaults to fix broken routing, gateway, or connectivity issues. Static IP settings will need to be re-entered; reboot recommended.	将系统 TCP/IP 配置恢复默认，修复异常路由、网关或无法上网问题（若曾设过静态 IP 需重新填写，建议重启）。
ReleaseRenewIpName	Release & renew DHCP IP	释放并重新获取 IP
ReleaseRenewIpDescription	Drops and requests a fresh DHCP address from your router when the PC has no valid IP or shows "No Internet".	向路由器重新申请 DHCP 地址，快速修复本机无有效 IP 或显示“无 Internet 访问”的问题。
DiskManagementName	Disk Management	磁盘管理
DiskManagementDescription	Assign drive letters, initialize new drives, and inspect or resize disk partitions.	管理新硬盘初始化、盘符分配以及分区创建与调整。
DiskCleanupName	Windows Disk Cleanup	Windows 磁盘清理
DiskCleanupDescription	Opens Windows' built-in Disk Cleanup utility for cleaning standard temporary and system update files.	打开系统自带磁盘清理工具，清理常规临时文件与更新缓存。
StorageSenseName	Storage Sense settings	存储感知设置
StorageSenseDescription	Configure Windows' automatic scheduled cleanup for temporary files, Recycle Bin, and cloud-backed files.	配置系统按计划自动清理临时文件、回收站与云端占位文件。
SystemFileCheckerName	Repair system files (SFC)	修复系统文件（SFC）
SystemFileCheckerDescription	Runs sfc /scannow to verify and restore corrupted Windows system files without touching your apps or personal data.	执行 sfc /scannow 扫描并自动修复损坏的 Windows 系统文件，不影响任何已装软件和个人数据。
DismRestoreHealthName	Repair Windows component store (DISM)	修复系统映像组件（DISM）
DismRestoreHealthDescription	Runs DISM /RestoreHealth to repair the Windows component store when SFC cannot fix files or Windows Update keeps failing. Safe and non-destructive.	执行 DISM /RestoreHealth 修复系统组件库，解决 SFC 无法修复或 Windows 更新屡次失败的问题，不影响个人文件。
EditHostsFileName	Edit hosts file	编辑 hosts 文件
EditHostsFileDescription	Opens Windows\System32\drivers\etc\hosts with admin privileges for local development overrides or blocking domains.	以管理员权限打开系统 hosts 文件，方便本地开发绑定域名或屏蔽特定地址。
SyncSystemTimeName	Sync system clock now	立即同步系统时间
SyncSystemTimeDescription	Triggers an immediate NTP time sync to fix HTTPS certificate errors, login failures, or 2FA code mismatches caused by clock drift.	立即触发一次 NTP 网络校时，快速修复时间偏差引起的证书报错、登录失败或验证码不匹配。
ResetMicrosoftStoreCacheName	Reset Microsoft Store cache	重置微软商店缓存
ResetMicrosoftStoreCacheDescription	Runs wsreset to clear Microsoft Store's cache when Store pages fail to load or app downloads get stuck. Does not uninstall any apps.	执行 wsreset 清理微软商店缓存，修复商店打不开或下载更新卡住的问题，不会卸载任何已装应用。
ReduceStartupDelayName	Remove startup app delay	取消开机启动项人为延迟
ReduceStartupDelayDescription	Windows artificially waits up to 10 seconds after showing the desktop before launching startup apps. Removing this delay makes your tray tools ready much faster, with virtually zero downside on modern SSDs.\nTakes effect at next sign-in.	Windows 进入桌面后会人为延迟几秒再启动开机自启程序。取消该延迟可让常用托盘工具更快就绪，在现代 SSD 上几乎没有开机卡顿代价。\n下次登录生效。
DisableWindowsCopilotName	Disable Windows Copilot	禁用 Windows Copilot
DisableWindowsCopilotDescription	Hides the Copilot taskbar button and stops its system integration from running in the background, freeing memory and clutter. Does not affect using AI tools in a browser.\nTakes effect after restarting Explorer.	隐藏 Copilot 按钮并停用系统级集成，减少后台内存占用与界面干扰，完全不影响在浏览器中使用各类 AI 工具。\n重启资源管理器生效。
DisableRecallName	Disable Windows Recall	禁用 Windows Recall（回顾）
DisableRecallDescription	Stops Recall from continuously taking and indexing screen snapshots, saving significant CPU, NPU, and disk space while protecting screen privacy. Zero impact if you don't use Recall.\nEffective immediately.	禁止系统持续截屏并建索引，大幅节省 CPU、NPU 和磁盘空间并保护屏幕隐私；不使用回顾功能完全零代价。\n立即生效。
DisableClickToDoName	Disable Click to Do	禁用点击即用（Click to Do）
DisableClickToDoDescription	Turns off on-screen AI content analysis overlays when clicking or selecting items, reducing background AI overhead and visual distractions with no loss of normal Windows features.\nEffective immediately.	关闭点击或框选屏幕时的 AI 内容分析覆盖层，减少后台 AI 占用与界面打扰，不影响正常系统操作。\n立即生效。
DisableEdgeAIFeaturesName	Disable Edge AI features	禁用 Edge 浏览器 AI 功能
DisableEdgeAIFeaturesDescription	Turns off Copilot sidebar, inline compose, AI history search, and local model prompts in Edge, cutting memory usage and sidebar clutter while keeping normal browsing untouched.\nEffective after group policy refresh.	关闭 Edge 中的 Copilot 侧边栏、写作提示、AI 历史搜索与本地模型推广，显著降低内存占用并清爽界面，正常浏览网页完全不受影响。\n刷新组策略后生效。
DisablePaintAIFeaturesName	Disable AI features in Paint	禁用“画图”中的 AI 功能
DisablePaintAIFeaturesDescription	Hides Cocreator, generative fill, and AI image tools in Microsoft Paint so the classic lightweight editor opens faster and stays uncluttered. Normal drawing, cropping, and resizing remain intact.\nEffective immediately.	关闭微软画图中的生成式填充、共同创作等 AI 工具，保持画图轻快简洁；裁剪、标注、缩放等常用功能完全不受影响。\n立即生效。
DisableNotepadAIFeaturesName	Disable AI features in Notepad	禁用“记事本”中的 AI 功能
DisableNotepadAIFeaturesDescription	Turns off AI rewrite and summarize menus in Windows Notepad, keeping it fast, distraction-free, and private without losing any standard text editing features.\nEffective immediately.	关闭记事本中的 AI 改写与总结菜单，保持纯文本编辑轻快无打扰，不损失任何基础编辑功能。\n立即生效。
DisableEdgeAdsAndSuggestionsName	Disable Edge ads, news feed, and shopping prompts	禁用 Edge 广告、资讯流与购物提示
DisableEdgeAdsAndSuggestionsDescription	Turns off the MSN new-tab news feed, shopping assistant, first-run nags, and personalized ad reporting in Edge, making new tabs instant and clean with zero loss of browsing features.\nEffective after group policy refresh.	关闭 Edge 新标签页资讯流、购物助手、推广推荐与首次引导，新标签页秒开更清爽，不影响任何正常浏览功能。\n刷新组策略后生效。
EnableTaskbarEndTaskName	Add "End Task" to taskbar right-click menu	任务栏右键菜单增加“结束任务”
EnableTaskbarEndTaskDescription	Lets you force-close frozen apps directly from their taskbar icon without opening Task Manager, saving time when a program hangs. Zero background overhead.\nEffective immediately.	应用卡死时直接在任务栏图标上右键即可强制结束，免去打开任务管理器寻找进程，且零后台开销。\n立即生效。
EnableLastActiveClickName	Switch to last active window on taskbar click	点击任务栏图标直接切回上次活动窗口
EnableLastActiveClickDescription	Clicking a multi-window taskbar icon immediately focuses the last active window (and clicks again to cycle windows) instead of forcing you to pick from tiny thumbnails every time. Hover previews still work.\nEffective immediately.	点击多窗口应用的任务栏图标时，直接切回上次使用的窗口（再点即可轮换窗口），无需每次从缩略图里点选；鼠标悬停预览仍正常保留。\n立即生效。
HideChatTaskbarButtonName	Hide Chat / Teams button on taskbar	隐藏任务栏“聊天/Teams”按钮
HideChatTaskbarButtonDescription	Removes the Chat / Meet Now button from the taskbar to save space and clutter. Teams itself is not uninstalled if you still use it.\nEffective immediately.	隐藏任务栏上的聊天/立即开会图标，释放任务栏空间；不会卸载 Teams 本体，需要时仍可正常打开。\n立即生效。
DisableLockScreenTipsName	Disable lock screen tips and ads	禁用锁屏提示与推广文案
DisableLockScreenTipsDescription	Removes promotional tips, fun facts, and clickable links from the lock screen, keeping it clean with zero functional downside.\nEffective immediately.	移除锁屏界面上的推广提示、趣闻与跳转链接，让锁屏保持干净整洁，无任何副作用。\n立即生效。
DisableSettings365AdsName	Disable Microsoft 365 ads in Settings	禁用设置中的 Microsoft 365 推广广告
DisableSettings365AdsDescription	Hides Microsoft 365, OneDrive storage, and account subscription banners inside Settings, making Settings cleaner without affecting your Microsoft account or Office apps.\nEffective after group policy refresh.	隐藏“设置”中的 Microsoft 365、OneDrive 扩容与订阅横幅，界面更干净，不影响 Microsoft 帐户或 Office 正常使用。\n刷新组策略后生效。
HideSettingsHomePageName	Skip Settings Home page	跳过“设置”主页（直接进入系统页）
HideSettingsHomePageDescription	Hides the promo-heavy Settings Home page so opening Settings lands straight on System, saving a click every time. Every real setting remains accessible in the left sidebar.\nEffective immediately.	隐藏以推广卡片为主的“设置主页”，打开设置直接进入“系统”页，少点一次更高效；所有设置项仍在左侧栏完整保留。\n立即生效。
DisableLocationServicesName	Disable Windows location services	禁用 Windows 位置服务
DisableLocationServicesDescription	Turns off system-wide location tracking so Windows and apps cannot read your location in the background, improving privacy and saving minor background work. Only needed if you rely on automatic desktop weather/maps positioning.\nEffective after group policy refresh.	全局关闭系统位置定位，阻止后台获取地理位置以保护隐私。仅在依赖桌面天气或地图自动定位时需要，台式机基本用不到。\n刷新组策略后生效。
DisableFindMyDeviceName	Disable Find My Device	禁用“查找我的设备”
DisableFindMyDeviceDescription	Stops Windows from periodically uploading this PC's location to Microsoft for device tracking, improving privacy with zero impact on desktop PCs that never leave home/office.\nEffective after group policy refresh.	停止定期向微软上报本机位置用于设备找回，提升隐私。对不会随身携带的台式机几乎完全没有必要开启。\n刷新组策略后生效。
DisableSearchHistoryName	Disable Windows search history	禁用 Windows 搜索历史记录
DisableSearchHistoryDescription	Stops Windows Search from storing past search queries on this device, improving privacy on shared PCs with no impact on search speed or results.\nEffective immediately.	禁止 Windows 搜索保存本机历史搜索词，保护隐私且不影响搜索速度与结果。\n立即生效。
DisableSearchHistoryUcpdMessage	Automatic apply failed (Windows UCPD is blocking registry writes to SearchSettings).\n\nSettings → Privacy & security → Search permissions has been opened.\nTurn off "Search history on this device", then toggle this item again or restart the app.	自动应用失败（Windows UCPD 阻止写入 SearchSettings）。\n\n已打开「设置 → 隐私和安全性 → 搜索权限」。\n请关闭「此设备上的搜索历史记录」，然后重新切换本项或重启本程序。
ShowHiddenFilesAndFoldersName	Show hidden files and folders	显示隐藏的文件和文件夹
ShowHiddenFilesAndFoldersDescription	Makes hidden config folders (like AppData and .git) visible in File Explorer so troubleshooting and development are much easier. Protected OS files remain hidden to prevent accidental deletion.\nEffective immediately.	在资源管理器中显示 AppData、.git 等隐藏配置目录，便于日常排查和开发；受保护的系统关键文件仍默认隐藏，不易误删。\n立即生效。
HideHomeFromExplorerName	Hide "Home" from File Explorer sidebar	隐藏资源管理器左侧栏“主页”
HideHomeFromExplorerDescription	Removes the redundant Home entry from the navigation pane so your drives and pinned folders sit higher and cleaner. Does not delete any files.\nTakes effect after restarting Explorer.	从左侧导航栏移除冗余的“主页”入口，让磁盘和常用目录更靠前清爽，不会删除任何文件。\n重启资源管理器生效。
HideGalleryFromExplorerName	Hide "Gallery" from File Explorer sidebar	隐藏资源管理器左侧栏“图库”
HideGalleryFromExplorerDescription	Removes the Gallery photo view from the navigation pane, preventing accidental slow photo indexing and keeping the sidebar compact. Your Pictures folder remains untouched.\nTakes effect after restarting Explorer.	从左侧导航栏移除“图库”入口，避免误点触发海量图片加载卡顿并让侧栏更精简；图片文件夹本身不受任何影响。\n重启资源管理器生效。
HideOneDriveFromExplorerName	Hide OneDrive from File Explorer sidebar	隐藏资源管理器左侧栏 OneDrive
HideOneDriveFromExplorerDescription	Removes the OneDrive shortcut from the navigation pane to declutter the sidebar without uninstalling OneDrive or deleting any synced files.\nTakes effect after restarting Explorer.	仅从资源管理器左侧栏隐藏 OneDrive 入口以保持简洁，不会卸载 OneDrive 也不会删除任何同步文件。\n重启资源管理器生效。
DisableStickyKeysShortcutName	Disable Sticky Keys 5×Shift popup	禁用连按 5 次 Shift 弹出粘滞键提示
DisableStickyKeysShortcutDescription	Stops the loud beep and Sticky Keys dialog from interrupting games or typing when Shift is tapped five times. You can still turn Sticky Keys on anytime in Accessibility settings.\nEffective immediately.	防止玩游戏或快速打字连按五次 Shift 时突然发出“滴”声并弹窗打断；需要时仍可在辅助功能设置中手动开启。\n立即生效。
DisableBitLockerAutoEncryptionName	Prevent automatic BitLocker device encryption	阻止自动启用 BitLocker 设备加密
DisableBitLockerAutoEncryptionDescription	Stops Windows from silently encrypting drives on new setups, avoiding unexpected SSD I/O overhead and recovery-key lockouts after BIOS/hardware changes. Does not decrypt drives that are already encrypted, and you can still enable BitLocker manually anytime.\nEffective immediately.	阻止系统静默自动加密磁盘，避免无感知的磁盘性能损耗及升级 BIOS/换硬件后因缺恢复密钥导致数据锁死。不会解密已加密的盘，需要时仍可手动开启。\n立即生效。
DisableModernStandbyNetworkingName	Disconnect network during Modern Standby	新式待机时断开网络连接
DisableModernStandbyNetworkingDescription	Stops laptops/PCs in Modern Standby (S0 low-power sleep) from staying connected to Wi-Fi and waking up in a bag, preventing overnight battery drain and heat. Only delays background mail/notifications until you wake the PC.\nEffective after group policy refresh.	在支持新式待机（S0）的设备上休眠期间断开网络，防止电脑合盖放包里持续联网发热掉电；仅在唤醒后再收取新消息，完全可接受。\n刷新组策略后生效。
DisableShareDragTrayName	Disable drag-to-share tray	禁用拖动文件时的顶部共享托盘
DisableShareDragTrayDescription	Turns off the Windows 11 top-of-screen share bar that pops up whenever you drag a file, preventing accidental drops and visual clutter. Normal drag-and-drop and right-click Share are unaffected.\nEffective immediately.	关闭拖动文件时屏幕顶部自动弹出的共享托盘，避免误拖和视觉干扰；正常拖放文件与右键共享功能不受影响。\n立即生效。
DisableGameBarIntegrationName	Disable Xbox Game Bar shortcuts & integration	禁用 Xbox Game Bar 快捷键与集成
DisableGameBarIntegrationDescription	Prevents controller guide buttons and system hooks from popping up Xbox Game Bar overlays during games. Pair with "Disable Game DVR" for a fuller cleanup; Game Mode stays active.\nEffective immediately.	阻止手柄按键及相关系统钩子在游戏时误弹出 Xbox Game Bar 覆盖层，可与“禁用 Game DVR”搭配使用，不影响游戏模式。\n立即生效。
DisableUpdateAsSoonAsAvailableName	Do not install early preview updates automatically	关闭“尽快获取最新更新”
DisableUpdateAsSoonAsAvailableDescription	Opts out of early-wave "seeker" feature updates so your PC receives tested regular updates instead of acting as an early guinea pig. Regular monthly security updates continue normally.\nEffective immediately.	关闭抢先推送尝鲜更新，避免当微软首批测试小白鼠引发兼容问题；正常的月度稳定版安全补丁仍照常接收。\n立即生效。
PreventDeviceCompanionAppAutoInstallName	Prevent auto-installing vendor companion apps	禁止自动安装硬件厂商配套应用
PreventDeviceCompanionAppAutoInstallDescription	Stops Windows from automatically downloading bloated vendor companion apps (like printer/mouse promo suites) whenever you plug in hardware. Standard hardware drivers from Windows Update still install normally.\nEffective after group policy refresh.	插入外设时不再自动从网络下载臃肿的厂商配套推广软件，保持系统干净；Windows Update 提供的正常硬件驱动仍可照常安装。\n刷新组策略后生效。
DisablePhoneLinkInStartName	Hide Phone Link panel in Start menu	隐藏开始菜单中的“手机连接”侧栏
DisablePhoneLinkInStartDescription	Removes the mobile companion side panel from the Start menu so it stays compact and uncluttered. Does not uninstall Phone Link if you still open it manually.\nEffective immediately.	隐藏开始菜单旁附带的手机连接面板，让开始菜单更紧凑清爽；不会卸载手机连接应用本身。\n立即生效。
DisableCortanaInSearchName	Disable Cortana in Windows Search	禁用 Windows 搜索中的 Cortana 集成
DisableCortanaInSearchDescription	Turns off legacy Cortana hooks and consent policies inside Windows Search, keeping search cleaner with zero impact on local search.\nEffective after group policy refresh.	通过策略关闭 Windows 搜索中残留的 Cortana 集成与授权项，减少冗余逻辑，对本地搜索零影响。\n刷新组策略后生效。
DisableWSAIFabricServiceName	Disable Windows AI Fabric service	禁用 Windows AI 基础服务（WSAIFabricSvc）
DisableWSAIFabricServiceDescription	Stops the background service powering built-in Windows AI features (like Recall and Click to Do), freeing background resources. Safe to disable if you don't use built-in Windows AI tools.\nEffective immediately.	停用支撑系统内置 AI 功能（如 Recall、点击即用）的后台服务，减少常驻占用；不使用系统自带 AI 功能完全零影响。\n立即生效。
UninstallCopilotName	Uninstall Microsoft Copilot	卸载 Microsoft Copilot
UninstallCopilotDescription	Removes the preinstalled Microsoft Copilot Store app package to free up clutter and background updates. Can be reinstalled from Microsoft Store or used in a browser anytime.	卸载预装的 Microsoft Copilot 应用包，减少界面冗余与后台更新；需要时可随时用网页版或重新安装。
UninstallTeamsName	Uninstall Microsoft Teams	卸载新版 Microsoft Teams
UninstallTeamsDescription	Removes the preinstalled consumer Microsoft Teams app to free space and avoid auto-start clutter. Can be reinstalled anytime if you need Teams meetings.	卸载预装的新版 Microsoft Teams 应用，减少空间占用与自启干扰；需要使用时可随时重新安装。
UninstallTeamsLegacyName	Uninstall legacy Microsoft Teams	卸载旧版 Microsoft Teams
UninstallTeamsLegacyDescription	Removes the discontinued legacy Teams Store app package that is no longer needed, with zero downside.	卸载已淘汰的旧版 Microsoft Teams 商店包，清理历史残留，完全无副作用。
UninstallPhoneLinkName	Uninstall Phone Link	卸载“手机连接”应用
UninstallPhoneLinkDescription	Removes the Phone Link (Your Phone) app and its background companion processes. Safe to uninstall if you don't sync phone messages/calls on this PC, and reinstallable from Microsoft Store anytime.	卸载“手机连接（Your Phone）”应用及其后台进程；不用电脑同步手机短信/通话时卸载完全无影响，需要时可从商店装回。
UninstallXboxGamingAppName	Uninstall Xbox app	卸载 Xbox 游戏应用
UninstallXboxGamingAppDescription	Removes the Xbox PC store/library app to cut background services and updates. Trade-off: breaks PC Game Pass and Xbox-app game management—only enable if you don't play Xbox/Game Pass PC games.	卸载用于管理 Xbox PC 游戏库的应用，减少后台占用与更新。代价是无法使用 PC Game Pass 或通过 Xbox 应用启动游戏，仅建议不玩 Xbox PC 游戏的用户开启。
UninstallPCManagerName	Uninstall Microsoft PC Manager	卸载微软电脑管家
UninstallPCManagerDescription	Removes preinstalled Microsoft PC Manager to avoid redundant background monitoring and tray clutter, with zero impact on Windows functionality.	卸载预装的微软电脑管家，避免重复的后台常驻监控与托盘干扰，对系统正常功能零影响。
DisableNtfs8Dot3NameCreationName	Disable NTFS 8.3 short filename creation	禁用 NTFS 8.3 短文件名生成
DisableNtfs8Dot3NameCreationDescription	Stops NTFS from generating legacy MS-DOS 8.3 aliases for every new file, noticeably speeding up file creation and directory enumeration in folders with thousands of files (like node_modules or build outputs). Only affects ultra-legacy 16-bit DOS apps that modern PCs never run.\nTakes effect after reboot.	新建文件时不再额外生成古老的 MS-DOS 8.3 短文件名，在包含海量文件的目录（如代码仓库、编译产物）中可明显加快创建和遍历速度；现代 32/64 位软件完全不依赖它，几乎零代价。\n重启生效。
DisableNtfsLastAccessUpdateName	Disable NTFS last access timestamp	禁用 NTFS 末次访问时间更新
DisableNtfsLastAccessUpdateDescription	Stops Windows from writing a new timestamp to disk every time a file is merely read, cutting unnecessary SSD wear and metadata I/O. Only affects rare backup/audit tools that check "Last Accessed" time (Modified and Created times stay accurate).\nEffective immediately.	读取文件时不再顺带回写“末次访问时间”，减少大量无意义的磁盘元数据写入与 SSD 磨损。不影响“修改时间”和“创建时间”，绝大多数用户和软件完全无感。\n立即生效。
DisableWapPushMessageRoutingServiceName	Disable WAP Push Message Routing service	禁用 WAP 推送消息路由服务
DisableWapPushMessageRoutingServiceDescription	Stops the dmwappushservice background service used mainly for enterprise MDM push and telemetry routing, reducing background clutter with zero impact on home or personal PCs.\nEffective immediately.	停用主要用于企业 MDM 推送和遥测路由的 dmwappushservice 后台服务，减少冗余常驻，对个人电脑完全零影响。\n立即生效。
DisableDownloadedMapsManagerServiceName	Disable Downloaded Maps Manager service	禁用离线地图管理服务
DisableDownloadedMapsManagerServiceDescription	Stops MapsBroker from running in the background to update downloaded Windows Maps data. Only needed if you use the built-in Windows Maps app offline.\nEffective immediately.	停用后台检查和更新离线地图数据的 MapsBroker 服务；只要不用系统自带的离线地图，禁用完全零影响。\n立即生效。
DisableHibernationName	Disable hibernation (delete hiberfil.sys)	关闭休眠（释放 hiberfil.sys 空间）
DisableHibernationDescription	Deletes hiberfil.sys (often 10–30+ GB on high-RAM PCs) and forces clean full shutdowns instead of Fast Startup. Trade-off: disables Hibernation (Sleep still works normally); great for desktops and plugged-in PCs, but keep off if your laptop relies on Hibernation.\nEffective immediately.	关闭休眠并直接删除与内存容量相当的 hiberfil.sys（大内存电脑可立省十几至几十 GB 空间），同时让关机更彻底。代价是无法使用“休眠”功能（“睡眠”仍正常）；台式机收益很大，依赖休眠的笔记本不建议开启。\n立即生效。
DisableBackgroundAppsName	Disable UWP/Store background apps	禁用商店应用后台运行
DisableBackgroundAppsDescription	Stops UWP/Microsoft Store apps from quietly running in the background when you aren't using them, reducing idle CPU, RAM, and network activity. Does not affect normal desktop (.exe) software; only delays background updates/notifications for Store apps.\nEffective immediately for most apps.	阻止 UWP/微软商店应用在关闭后继续于后台偷偷运行，降低空闲 CPU、内存与联网占用。不影响普通桌面（.exe）软件，仅会暂停商店应用关闭后的后台静默刷新。\n对多数应用立即生效。
DisableAutomaticMaintenanceName	Disable Windows Automatic Maintenance	禁用 Windows 自动维护
DisableAutomaticMaintenanceDescription	Stops Windows from launching unexpected diagnostics, defrag, and maintenance scans whenever you step away, preventing sudden fan spin-up, CPU spikes, and disk thrashing. You can still run updates and cleanup manually whenever you like.\nEffective immediately.	阻止电脑一空闲就自动启动诊断、整理与扫描任务，避免突然风扇狂转、磁盘满载或打断后台工作；需要时仍可随时手动更新与清理。\n立即生效。
DisablePowerThrottlingName	Disable power throttling	禁用电源限流
DisablePowerThrottlingDescription	Stops Windows from throttling background processes (downloads, sync, builds, audio/capture tools), keeping multitasking and background tasks consistently responsive. Extra power draw is minimal when plugged in, but this setting also applies on battery power so laptops that rely on battery life should leave it off.\nTakes effect after reboot.	避免 Windows 自动把后台进程（如下载、同步、编译、音频/录屏工具）降频限速，让多任务和后台工作更稳定跟手。插电使用时额外功耗很低、几乎无感；但此项同时作用于电池状态，经常不插电移动办公的笔记本建议保持关闭。\n重启生效。
EnableHardwareAcceleratedGpuSchedulingName	Enable Hardware-Accelerated GPU Scheduling (HAGS)	启用硬件加速 GPU 计划（HAGS）
EnableHardwareAcceleratedGpuSchedulingDescription	Offloads video memory scheduling from the CPU to the GPU's own processor, reducing input latency and enabling features like DLSS 3 Frame Generation. Minimal risk on modern RTX/RDNA drivers; easily reversible if a specific app stutters.\nTakes effect after reboot.	将显存调度从 CPU 下放给显卡自行处理，可降低游戏延迟并解锁 DLSS 帧生成等新特性。在现代显卡驱动上已非常成熟，如遇个别软件异常可随时关回。\n重启生效。
PreferProgramsProcessorSchedulingName	Prioritize foreground apps in CPU scheduling	CPU 调度优先前台程序
PreferProgramsProcessorSchedulingDescription	Restores the standard desktop Win32PrioritySeparation setting so active foreground apps feel snappy over background services. Zero downside on desktop/workstation PCs.\nApplies to new processes.	确保 CPU 时间片优先响应当前前台操作窗口而非后台服务（标准桌面推荐配置），让交互更跟手，对桌面电脑几乎零代价。\n对新进程生效。
DisableConnectedDevicesPlatformServiceName	Disable Connected Devices Platform service	禁用连接设备平台服务（CDPSvc）
DisableConnectedDevicesPlatformServiceDescription	Stops CDPSvc from running background cross-device discovery and sync (Nearby Sharing, Phone Link, Continue on PC), saving background memory and network chatter. Safe to disable if you don't use those Windows cross-device features.\nEffective immediately.	停用负责附近共享、手机连接与跨设备接力的 CDPSvc 后台服务，减少后台占用与局域网广播；不使用这些 Windows 跨设备功能完全零影响。\n立即生效。
DisableConnectedDevicesPlatformUserServiceName	Disable Connected Devices Platform user service	禁用连接设备平台用户服务（CDPUserSvc）
DisableConnectedDevicesPlatformUserServiceDescription	Stops the per-user companion service to CDPSvc to further cut cross-device background activity. Only affects Nearby Sharing and Windows cross-device sync.\nEffective immediately.	停用 CDPSvc 的每用户配套后台服务，进一步减少跨设备与共享后台占用；仅影响附近共享及跨设备体验。\n立即生效。
DisableXboxAuthManagerServiceName	Disable Xbox Live Auth Manager service	禁用 Xbox Live 身份验证服务
DisableXboxAuthManagerServiceDescription	Stops the Xbox Live sign-in service (XblAuthManager) from staying registered in the background. Zero downside if you don't use Xbox apps, Game Pass, or Microsoft Store games.\nEffective immediately.	停用负责 Xbox Live 登录的后台服务。若不玩 Game Pass 或 Xbox 商店游戏，禁用完全无影响。\n立即生效。
DisableXboxGameSaveServiceName	Disable Xbox Live Game Save service	禁用 Xbox Live 云存档服务
DisableXboxGameSaveServiceDescription	Stops the Xbox cloud save sync service (XblGameSave). Does not affect Steam/Epic/other game launchers; only needed for Xbox/Microsoft Store games.\nEffective immediately.	停用 Xbox 云存档同步服务。完全不影响 Steam、Epic 等其他平台游戏，仅在玩 Xbox/商店游戏时需要。\n立即生效。
DisableXboxNetApiServiceName	Disable Xbox Live Networking service	禁用 Xbox Live 网络服务
DisableXboxNetApiServiceDescription	Stops the Xbox Live multiplayer networking service (XboxNetApiSvc). Does not affect regular internet, Steam, or other games—only Xbox/Microsoft Store online games.\nEffective immediately.	停用 Xbox Live 联机支持服务。不影响正常上网或 Steam 等其他游戏，仅玩 Xbox/商店联机游戏时需要。\n立即生效。
DisableXboxGipServiceName	Disable Xbox Accessory Management service	禁用 Xbox 配件管理服务
DisableXboxGipServiceDescription	Stops XboxGipSvc for Xbox controller firmware and accessories. Trade-off: disables Xbox wireless/wired controller support—only enable if you do not use Xbox controllers on this PC.\nEffective immediately.	停用管理 Xbox 手柄与配件的后台服务。代价是会影响 Xbox 手柄连接，仅建议完全不用 Xbox 手柄的用户开启。\n立即生效。
DisableApplicationExperienceTasksName	Disable Application Experience scheduled tasks	禁用应用程序体验计划任务
DisableApplicationExperienceTasksDescription	Disables background compatibility scanners (such as Microsoft Compatibility Appraiser) that frequently spike disk and CPU to upload software inventory telemetry. Does not affect running or installing programs.\nEffective immediately.	禁用后台定期全盘扫描软件并上报遥测的兼容性评估任务，避免莫名其妙的磁盘与 CPU 飙升，完全不影响软件正常运行与安装。\n立即生效。
DisableCustomerExperienceTasksName	Disable Customer Experience (CEIP/SQM) tasks	禁用客户体验改善（CEIP/SQM）计划任务
DisableCustomerExperienceTasksDescription	Disables scheduled telemetry tasks (Consolidator, UsbCeip, KernelCeip, Autochk Proxy) that periodically wake to collect and upload usage stats. Zero impact on system functionality.\nEffective immediately.	禁用定期唤醒收集并上传使用数据的遥测计划任务，减少后台干扰与隐私上传，对系统功能零影响。\n立即生效。
DisableDiskDiagnosticTasksName	Disable Disk Diagnostic scheduled tasks	禁用磁盘诊断计划任务
DisableDiskDiagnosticTasksDescription	Disables background disk diagnostic telemetry tasks so Windows doesn't trigger extra disk checks and reporting. You can check drive SMART health much more clearly anytime using CrystalDiskInfo in the Tools tab.\nEffective immediately.	禁用后台磁盘诊断数据收集任务，减少多余磁盘检测与上报；需要查看硬盘健康随时可用“工具”页的 CrystalDiskInfo，信息更直观。\n立即生效。
DisableFeedbackScheduledTasksName	Disable feedback scheduled tasks	禁用反馈调查计划任务
DisableFeedbackScheduledTasksDescription	Disables background SIUF tasks that download survey scenarios and schedule feedback prompts, cutting pointless background wakeups with zero downside.\nEffective immediately.	禁用定期下载调查问卷并触发反馈弹窗的后台计划任务，减少无意义唤醒，完全零副作用。\n立即生效。
DisableWerQueueReportingTaskName	Disable Windows Error Reporting queue task	禁用 Windows 错误报告队列上传任务
DisableWerQueueReportingTaskDescription	Disables the scheduled task that uploads queued crash reports to Microsoft, avoiding unnecessary background uploads while leaving local Event Viewer logs intact.\nEffective immediately.	禁用定时把崩溃报告队列上传至微软的计划任务，减少多余联网，不影响本地事件查看器排错。\n立即生效。
DisableNearbySharingName	Disable Nearby Sharing	禁用附近共享
DisableNearbySharingDescription	Turns off Bluetooth/Wi-Fi Nearby Sharing discovery so this PC stops broadcasting to nearby devices, saving background radio work and improving privacy. Easy to re-enable if you ever transfer files this way.\nEffective immediately.	关闭基于蓝牙/Wi-Fi 的附近共享发现，避免电脑持续对外广播并保护隐私，需要传文件时随时可重新开启。\n立即生效。
DisableCloudClipboardSyncName	Disable cloud clipboard sync	禁用剪贴板云同步
DisableCloudClipboardSyncDescription	Stops copied text and passwords from uploading to Microsoft's cloud for cross-device sync, improving privacy and security. Local Win+V clipboard history keeps working normally.\nEffective after group policy refresh.	禁止把复制的文本和密码上传至微软云端跨设备同步，更安全护隐私；本机 Win+V 剪贴板历史功能完全不受影响。\n刷新组策略后生效。
DisableSharedExperiencesName	Disable cross-device shared experiences	禁用跨设备共享体验
DisableSharedExperiencesDescription	Turns off background "continue apps on other devices" sync, reducing background Connected Devices activity with zero impact if you work primarily on this PC.\nEffective immediately.	关闭“在其他设备上继续使用应用”的后台同步机制，减少后台资源占用；主要在单机工作时完全零影响。\n立即生效。
DisableWindowsTipsAndSuggestionsName	Disable Windows tips and suggestions	禁用 Windows 使用技巧与推广建议
DisableWindowsTipsAndSuggestionsDescription	Turns off Soft Landing popups, Settings tips, and promotional Windows suggestions, eliminating notification noise with zero functional loss.\nEffective immediately.	关闭系统各处弹出的使用技巧、提示卡片和推广建议，界面清净无打扰，不损失任何功能。\n立即生效。
DisableAccountNotificationsName	Disable Microsoft account notifications	禁用 Microsoft 帐户推广通知
DisableAccountNotificationsDescription	Silences nagging banners in Settings and Start pushing Microsoft 365, backup, or account actions, without affecting your actual Microsoft account sign-in.\nEffective immediately.	关闭开始菜单和设置中反复催促开通会员、备份或完善账户的通知横幅，不影响 Microsoft 帐户正常登录。\n立即生效。
DisableScoobeStartupExperienceName	Disable post-update setup prompts (SCOOBE)	禁用更新后的全屏设置引导（SCOOBE）
DisableScoobeStartupExperienceDescription	Stops the full-screen "Let's finish setting up your device" nag screens that appear after Windows updates trying to switch defaults to Edge/OneDrive/365. Zero downside.\nEffective immediately.	禁止系统更新重启后弹出“让我们完成设备设置”的全屏推销界面（诱导切换 Edge/OneDrive/365），彻底免打扰且零副作用。\n立即生效。
DisableOfficeTelemetryName	Disable Microsoft Office telemetry	禁用 Microsoft Office 遥测
DisableOfficeTelemetryDescription	Stops Microsoft Office from collecting usage telemetry and logging document/add-in telemetry via OSM, improving privacy with zero impact on Word, Excel, or PowerPoint. Harmless if Office is not installed.\nEffective for new Office processes.	关闭 Microsoft Office 客户端遥测上传与 OSM 日志记录，保护文档使用隐私，不影响 Word/Excel/PowerPoint 任何功能；未安装 Office 也无副作用。\n对新启动的 Office 进程生效。
DisableOfflineFilesServiceName	Disable Offline Files service	禁用脱机文件服务
DisableOfflineFilesServiceDescription	Stops CscService from managing cached copies of corporate network shares. Almost no home or personal PC uses Windows Offline Files, so disabling it cuts background overhead with zero downside.\nEffective immediately.	停用主要用于缓存企业网络共享文件夹的脱机文件服务（CscService），个人电脑几乎用不到，禁用可减少后台开销且零影响。\n立即生效。
DisableCloudExperienceHostTasksName	Disable Cloud Experience Host tasks	禁用云体验主机计划任务
DisableCloudExperienceHostTasksDescription	Disables background account/cloud onboarding scheduled tasks that run post-setup prompts, reducing unnecessary background work with zero downside.\nEffective immediately.	禁用后台运行账户与云端引导提示的计划任务，减少无用后台活动，完全无副作用。\n立即生效。
DisableSustainabilityTelemetryTasksName	Disable sustainability telemetry tasks	禁用可持续性遥测计划任务
DisableSustainabilityTelemetryTasksDescription	Disables scheduled tasks that collect and upload device energy/carbon telemetry to Microsoft. Zero effect on power management or performance.\nEffective immediately.	禁用向微软收集并上传能耗/碳排放遥测数据的计划任务，不影响电脑正常电源管理与性能。\n立即生效。
DisableOfficeTelemetryTasksName	Disable Office telemetry scheduled tasks	禁用 Office 遥测计划任务
DisableOfficeTelemetryTasksDescription	Disables Office Telemetry Agent scheduled tasks that periodically scan and upload Office usage data, saving background wakeups without affecting any Office features. Safely skipped if Office isn't installed.\nEffective immediately.	禁用定期唤醒扫描并上传 Office 使用数据的遥测代理计划任务，减少后台占用且不影响任何 Office 功能；未装 Office 时自动跳过。\n立即生效。
UninstallBingSearchName	Uninstall Bing Search package	卸载 Bing 搜索组件
UninstallBingSearchDescription	Removes the Bing web-search integration package from Windows Search, making Start menu search cleaner and faster with zero impact on local search or using Bing in a browser.	卸载集成在 Windows 搜索中的 Bing 网页搜索组件，让开始菜单搜索更纯粹流畅，不影响本地搜索或在浏览器访问 Bing。
UninstallCrossDeviceName	Uninstall Cross Device Experience Host	卸载跨设备体验主机
UninstallCrossDeviceDescription	Removes the background host used to bridge Android/iOS phones with Windows (camera/file sync). Safe to remove if you don't link your phone to Windows, and reinstallable anytime.	卸载用于桥接手机与 Windows 同步的跨设备体验后台组件；不把手机绑定到 Windows 时卸载完全无影响，需要时可装回。
UninstallStartExperiencesAppName	Uninstall Start Experiences App	卸载开始体验应用
UninstallStartExperiencesAppDescription	Removes the Microsoft Start Experiences companion package that powers web/feed widgets in Start, reducing bloat without affecting normal Start menu app launching.	卸载为开始菜单提供资讯/推广内容的附加组件，减少系统冗余，不影响正常的开始菜单启动软件。
UninstallGamingServicesName	Uninstall Microsoft Gaming Services	卸载 Microsoft 游戏服务
UninstallGamingServicesDescription	Removes the background Gaming Services package used by Xbox/Store PC games. Trade-off: breaks PC Game Pass and Xbox Store games (does not affect Steam/Epic); only enable if you don't play Xbox PC games.	卸载供 Xbox/商店 PC 游戏使用的后台游戏服务组件。代价是无法运行 PC Game Pass 与微软商店游戏（不影响 Steam/Epic），仅建议不玩 Xbox PC 游戏的用户开启。
LanguageSystem	Follow system	跟随系统
Settings	Settings	设置
StorageMode	Settings storage	配置存储位置
StorageModeDefault	Default (Roaming)	默认（用户漫游目录）
StorageModePortable	Portable (App folder)	便携（程序目录）
StorageModeCustom	Custom folder…	自定义目录…
StorageModeCustomPickerTitle	Choose a folder to store settings	选择用于保存配置的文件夹
StorageSwitchTitle	Switch settings storage	切换配置存储位置
StorageSwitchMoveFilesMessage	Move your existing settings files to the new location?\nChoose No to keep the old files where they are and start using the new folder directly.	是否将现有配置文件迁移到新位置？\n选择“否”将保留旧文件，直接改用新位置存储。
StorageSwitchPortableMustMoveMessage	Leaving portable mode requires moving the settings files out of the app folder, otherwise the app will switch back to portable mode next time. Move the files and continue?	退出便携模式必须移走程序目录中的配置文件，否则下次启动仍会自动进入便携模式。是否迁移文件并继续？
UpdateInterval	Check interval	自动检查间隔
UpdateIntervalEvery6Hours	Every 6 hours	每 6 小时
UpdateIntervalDaily	Daily	每天
UpdateIntervalWeekly	Weekly	每周
UpdateIntervalNever	Never	从不
DiskSpace	{0}: Drive Space	{0} 盘空间
DiskSpaceDescription	Running low on system-drive space? Scan and safely clean system and developer caches first, then relocate large user folders, the paging file, or WSL/Docker disks to another drive.	系统盘空间告急？先扫描并安全清理系统与开发缓存，再将大体积用户文件夹、页面文件或 WSL/Docker 虚拟磁盘迁移到其他硬盘。
DiskSpaceCleanup	System and application cleanup	系统与应用清理
DiskSpaceRelocation	Relocate to another drive	迁移到其他磁盘
ScanDiskSpace	Rescan	重新扫描
CleanCheckedDiskSpaceItems	Clean checked	清理选中项
DiskSpaceSlowHint	Takes a while	耗时较长
DiskSpaceNotScanned	Not scanned yet	尚未扫描
DiskSpaceScanning	Scanning…	正在扫描…
DiskSpaceScanningAll	Scanning disk space…	正在扫描磁盘空间…
DiskSpaceScanFinished	Scan complete. About {0} can be freed.	扫描完成，预计可释放约 {0}。
DiskSpaceScanFinishedUpTo	Scan complete. Up to {0} can be freed.	扫描完成，最多可释放 {0}。
DiskSpaceReclaimableSummary	Reclaimable: about {0} (checked: {1})	可释放约 {0}（已选 {1}）
DiskSpaceReclaimableSummaryUpTo	Reclaimable: up to {0} (checked: {1})	最多可释放 {0}（已选 {1}）
DiskSpaceUpToSize	up to {0}	最多 {0}
DiskSpaceCleaning	Cleaning…	正在清理…
DiskSpaceCleaningItem	Cleaning: {0}…	正在清理：{0}…
DiskSpaceCleaned	Freed {0}	已释放 {0}
DiskSpaceCleanIncomplete	Some files were in use and could not be removed.	部分文件正被占用，未能删除。
DiskSpaceFailed	Failed: {0}	失败：{0}
DiskSpaceNothingToClean	No reclaimable data in the checked items.	选中的项目当前无需清理。
DiskSpaceCleanConfirmTitle	Confirm cleanup	确认清理
DiskSpaceCleanConfirmMessage	Clean {0} item(s) and free about {1}? Deleted files cannot be recovered.	即将清理 {0} 项，预计释放约 {1}。删除后无法恢复，是否继续？
DiskSpaceCleanConfirmMessageUpTo	Clean {0} item(s) and free up to {1}? Deleted files cannot be recovered.	即将清理 {0} 项，最多可释放 {1}。删除后无法恢复，是否继续？
DiskSpaceCleanCompleted	Cleanup complete. Freed {0}.	清理完成，共释放 {0}。
SystemDriveUsage	System drive {0}: {1} used of {2}, {3} free	系统盘 {0}：已用 {1} / 共 {2}，可用 {3}
DiskSpaceCurrentLocation	Current location: {0}	当前位置：{0}
DiskSpaceMove	Move	迁移
DiskSpaceMoving	Moving…	正在迁移…
DiskSpaceMovingItem	Moving: {0}…	正在迁移：{0}…
DiskSpaceMoved	Moved to {0}	已迁移至 {0}
DiskSpaceMovedRebootRequired	Set to {0} (takes effect after reboot)	已设为 {0}（重启后生效）
DiskSpaceMoveCompleted	Relocation complete: {0}	迁移完成：{0}
DiskSpaceMoveFailed	Relocation failed: {0}	迁移失败：{0}
DiskSpaceNoTargetDrive	No other NTFS drive available	没有其他可用的 NTFS 磁盘
DiskSpaceDriveLabel	{0} ({1}, {2} free)	{0}（{1}，可用 {2}）
DiskSpaceMoveConfirmTitle	Confirm relocation	确认迁移
DiskSpaceMoveConfirmMessage	Move "{0}" ({3})\nfrom: {1}\nto: {2}\nContinue?	将把“{0}”（{3}）\n从：{1}\n迁移到：{2}\n是否继续？
RecycleBinCleanupName	Recycle Bin	回收站
RecycleBinCleanupDescription	Permanently empties deleted files from the Recycle Bin on all drives. Check that you don't need to restore any deleted files first.	永久清空所有磁盘回收站中的文件。清理前请确认其中没有需要还原的误删文件。
TempFilesCleanupName	Temporary files	系统与用户临时文件
TempFilesCleanupDescription	Removes leftover temporary files from Windows\Temp and your user Temp folder while automatically skipping files in use. Completely safe, with zero impact on installed apps or personal data.	清理 Windows\Temp 与当前用户 Temp 目录中的临时残留，正在使用的文件会自动跳过。安全可清，不影响已装软件与个人数据。
WindowsUpdateCacheCleanupName	Windows Update download cache	Windows Update 下载缓存
WindowsUpdateCacheCleanupDescription	Clears downloaded update installers in SoftwareDistribution\Download. Safe to delete—Windows simply re-downloads anything still needed, and clearing it also unsticks failed updates.	清理 SoftwareDistribution\Download 中的已下载更新包。安全可清，系统需要时会自动重新下载，还能顺带修复卡住的系统更新。
DeliveryOptimizationCacheCleanupName	Delivery Optimization cache	传递优化缓存
DeliveryOptimizationCacheCleanupDescription	Deletes cached Windows Update and Store chunks kept for sharing with other PCs. Completely safe to clean with zero impact on installed apps or updates.	清理为向其他电脑分发而缓存的更新和商店安装包。安全可清，不影响已装应用或系统更新。
CrashDumpsCleanupName	System crash dumps	系统蓝屏崩溃转储
CrashDumpsCleanupDescription	Removes MEMORY.DMP, Minidump, and LiveKernelReports left behind by past blue screens and driver crashes, often reclaiming several gigabytes. Only useful if you are actively debugging a recent crash.	清理历史蓝屏和驱动故障遗留的 MEMORY.DMP、Minidump 与 LiveKernelReports，常可释放数 GB 空间；仅在排查近期蓝屏时有用。
WindowsLogsCleanupName	Servicing logs & error reports	系统维护日志与错误报告
WindowsLogsCleanupDescription	Clears CBS, DISM, and Windows Update logs plus queued error-reporting files. CBS logs can silently balloon to tens of gigabytes; safe to clean with no effect on Windows.	清理 CBS、DISM、Windows Update 日志及排队中的错误报告文件。CBS 日志有时会悄悄膨胀到几十 GB，安全可清，不影响系统运行。
PreviousInstallationCleanupName	Previous Windows version (Windows.old)	上一个 Windows 版本（Windows.old）
PreviousInstallationCleanupDescription	Removes Windows.old and upgrade leftovers kept after a major Windows update, often freeing 15–30 GB. Automatically checked once Windows' rollback window expires; deleting earlier only gives up rolling back to the old version.	清理大版本升级后保留的 Windows.old 与升级备份，常可释放 15~30 GB。回滚期过后会自动勾选；提前清理仅放弃“退回上一版本”功能，不影响当前系统。
PagingFileRelocationName	Paging file (virtual memory)	页面文件（虚拟内存）
PagingFileRelocationDescription	Moves pagefile.sys (often 8–32+ GB) to another drive as a single system-managed file. Takes effect after reboot. Trade-off: without a system-drive pagefile, Windows cannot write a full kernel dump on a blue screen (normal system operation is unaffected).	将 pagefile.sys（常占 8~32 GB 以上）迁移至其他磁盘并保持系统自动管理，重启生效。代价仅是蓝屏时无法写入完整内核转储，日常使用完全无影响。
DesktopRelocationName	Desktop folder	桌面文件夹
DesktopRelocationDescription	Relocates your Desktop folder to the chosen drive (e.g. D:\Desktop) using Windows' native folder redirection so desktop icons and apps keep working seamlessly.	采用 Windows 原生“位置”重定向将“桌面”迁移到所选盘根目录（如 D:\Desktop），桌面图标与所有软件照常使用，以后往桌面放大文件不再占 C 盘。
DocumentsRelocationName	Documents folder	文档文件夹
DocumentsRelocationDescription	Relocates your Documents folder to the chosen drive (e.g. D:\Documents) using Windows' native redirection. Apps storing data here (WeChat, games, Office) keep working seamlessly.	采用 Windows 原生重定向将“文档”迁移到所选盘（如 D:\Documents）。存放在此的微信、游戏存档和 Office 文件都会无缝继续工作。
DownloadsRelocationName	Downloads folder	下载文件夹
DownloadsRelocationDescription	Relocates your Downloads folder to the chosen drive (e.g. D:\Downloads)—usually the single biggest user folder—so browser downloads stop filling up the system drive.	将通常占用最大的“下载”文件夹迁移到所选盘（如 D:\Downloads），此后浏览器和下载工具默认保存的文件不再塞满系统盘。
PicturesRelocationName	Pictures folder	图片文件夹
PicturesRelocationDescription	Relocates your Pictures folder and screenshots to the chosen drive (e.g. D:\Pictures) using Windows' native redirection.	采用 Windows 原生重定向将“图片”及截图文件夹迁移到所选盘（如 D:\Pictures），应用无缝衔接。
MusicRelocationName	Music folder	音乐文件夹
MusicRelocationDescription	Relocates your Music folder to the chosen drive (e.g. D:\Music) using Windows' native redirection.	采用 Windows 原生重定向将“音乐”文件夹迁移到所选盘（如 D:\Music），应用无缝衔接。
VideosRelocationName	Videos folder	视频文件夹
VideosRelocationDescription	Relocates your Videos folder and screen recordings to the chosen drive (e.g. D:\Videos) using Windows' native redirection.	采用 Windows 原生重定向将“视频”及录屏文件夹迁移到所选盘（如 D:\Videos），应用无缝衔接。
PagingFileAutomatic	automatically managed	自动管理
PagingFileSystemManaged	system-managed size	系统自动管理大小
PagingFileNone	Disabled	未启用
DiskSpaceMoveTargetExistsNote	Note: the destination folder already exists and is not empty; moved files will be merged into it.	提示：目标文件夹已存在且不为空，迁移的文件将与其中现有内容合并。
DiskSpaceMoveProgressCopying	Copying… {0} / {1}	正在复制… {0} / {1}
DiskSpaceMoveProgressDeleting	Cleaning up source files…	正在清理源文件…
MoveCheckedDiskSpaceItems	Move checked	迁移选中项
DiskSpaceMoveSummary	checked to move: {0}	已选迁移 {0}
DiskSpaceRestoreDefault	Restore default	恢复默认位置
DiskSpaceRestoreDefaultConfirmTitle	Restore default location	确认恢复默认位置
DiskSpaceRestoreDefaultConfirmMessage	Move "{0}" ({3})\nfrom: {1}\nback to: {2}\nContinue?	将把“{0}”（{3}）\n从：{1}\n迁回：{2}\n是否继续？
DiskSpaceRestoringItem	Restoring: {0}…	正在迁回默认位置：{0}…
DiskSpaceRestoreCompleted	Restored to default: {0}	已迁回默认位置：{0}
DiskSpaceRestoreFailed	Restore failed: {0}	恢复失败：{0}
DiskSpaceNoItemsCheckedToMove	No relocation items are checked.	请先勾选要迁移的项目。
DiskSpaceBatchMoveConfirmTitle	Confirm batch relocation	确认批量迁移
DiskSpaceBatchMoveConfirmMessage	Move {0} item(s) totaling {1}:\n{2}\nContinue?	即将迁移 {0} 项，共 {1}：\n{2}\n是否继续？
DiskSpaceBatchMoveLine	{0}: {1} → {2} ({3})	{0}：{1} → {2}（{3}）
DiskSpaceBatchMoveInsufficientSpace	Not enough free space on {0}: {1} needed, {2} available.	{0} 可用空间不足：需要 {1}，当前仅剩 {2}。
DiskSpaceBatchMoveCompleted	Batch relocation complete: {0} succeeded, {1} failed.	批量迁移完成：成功 {0} 项，失败 {1} 项。
PagingFileDefaultLocation	Automatically managed (system drive)	自动管理（系统盘）
DriveTypeSsd	SSD	固态硬盘
DriveTypeHdd	HDD	机械硬盘
DriveTypeUnknown	Drive	磁盘
DiskSpaceRestored	Restored to default: {0}	已迁回默认位置：{0}
DiskSpaceRestoredRebootRequired	Restored to default ({0}, takes effect after reboot)	已恢复默认（{0}，重启后生效）
PreviousInstallationRollbackAvailable	You can still roll back to the previous Windows version for {0} more day(s); cleaning removes that option.	还剩 {0} 天可退回上一 Windows 版本，清理后将无法回退。
PreviousInstallationRollbackExpired	The rollback window has passed; safe to remove.	回滚期已过，可放心清理。
DismResetBaseName	Deep-clean WinSxS component store	深度清理 WinSxS 组件库
DismResetBaseDescription	Runs DISM /StartComponentCleanup /ResetBase to purge all superseded update components and reclaim extra gigabytes. Trade-off: currently installed updates can no longer be uninstalled (future updates work normally).	执行 DISM /StartComponentCleanup /ResetBase 彻底清除所有被替代的旧更新组件，进一步榨出数 GB 空间。代价仅是已装更新无法再卸载，不影响后续正常更新。
DiskSpaceScanInProgressHint	Still scanning; cleanup applies only to items that have finished scanning.	仍在扫描中，清理只会处理已完成扫描的项目。
DiskSpaceCleanCancelled	Cleanup was cancelled; actual freed space is unknown. Rescan before retrying.	清理已取消，实际释放量未知，请重新扫描后再试。
DiskSpaceCleanMeasurementFailed	Could not measure remaining size; actual freed space is unknown.	无法统计剩余大小，实际释放量未知。
DiskSpaceCleanCompletedWithErrors	Cleanup finished with some errors. Freed about {0}; check the failed items.	清理完成但部分项失败，已释放约 {0}，请查看失败项提示。
EdgeCacheCleanupName	Microsoft Edge cache	Microsoft Edge 缓存
ChromeCacheCleanupName	Google Chrome cache	Google Chrome 缓存
BrowserCacheCleanupDescription	Clears web and code caches in standard browser profiles. Close the browser (including background processes) first. Cookies, logins, bookmarks, history, and site data are untouched—pages just re-cache on next visit.	清理标准浏览器配置中的网页与脚本缓存（清理前请彻底关闭浏览器）。完全保留登录状态、Cookie、书签、历史记录与网站数据，仅下次访问网页时重新缓存。
BrowserCacheCloseFirst	Please close {0} (including background processes) before cleaning its cache.	请先彻底关闭 {0} 及其后台进程，再清理缓存。
NuGetHttpCacheCleanupName	NuGet download cache	NuGet 下载缓存
NuGetHttpCacheCleanupDescription	Clears NuGet HTTP download cache on the system drive via the .NET SDK while keeping extracted packages intact. Safe to clean; future new package downloads will simply fetch from the network again.	通过 .NET SDK 清理系统盘上的 NuGet HTTP 下载缓存，保留已解压包。安全可清，仅后续新拉取包时重新联网下载。
NuGetPackagesCleanupName	NuGet extracted global packages	NuGet 全局已解压包
NuGetPackagesCleanupDescription	Clears NuGet's global extracted packages on the system drive (close IDEs first). Safe for projects with online feeds, though next builds will need to restore packages again (offline builds may fail). Unchecked by default.	通过 .NET SDK 清理系统盘上的 NuGet 全局已解压包（请先关闭 IDE）。后续编译会重新还原依赖，离线或内网环境需注意，默认不勾选。
NuGetCacheQueryFailed	Could not query NuGet cache. Verify that the .NET SDK is installed and configured properly.	无法查询 NuGet 缓存，请确认已安装 .NET SDK 且配置正常。
NuGetCacheClearFailed	NuGet could not clear all cache files. Close development tools and try again.	NuGet 未能清理全部文件，请关闭开发工具后重试。
NuGetCacheUnsafePath	The NuGet cache points to a protected folder or symlink; skipped for safety.	NuGet 缓存路径位于受保护目录或包含链接，为安全起见已跳过。
UserCrashDumpsCleanupName	Application crash dumps	应用程序崩溃转储
UserCrashDumpsCleanupDescription	Removes .dmp files in LocalAppData\CrashDumps on the system drive left by crashed apps. Safe to delete unless you are debugging a specific app crash; unchecked by default.	清理系统盘 LocalAppData\CrashDumps 中由应用崩溃生成的 .dmp 文件。除非正在排查某款软件的崩溃问题，否则可放心清理；默认不勾选。
CleanDiskSpaceItem	Clean	清理
DiskSpaceQueuedButton	Queued	排队中
DiskSpaceQueuePosition	Queued (#{0})	排队中（第 {0} 项）
DiskSpaceOperationQueueRunning	Running: {0} ({1} waiting)	正在执行：{0}（还有 {1} 项等待）
DiskSpaceOperationQueueCompleted	Queue finished: {0} succeeded, {1} failed. Freed about {2}.	队列执行完成：成功 {0} 项，失败 {1} 项，共释放约 {2}。
DiskSpaceQueuedSourceChanged	The source location changed while queued. Please rescan and confirm again.	等待期间源位置已发生变化，请重新扫描后再确认迁移。
DiskSpaceQueuedTargetUnavailable	The selected destination drive is no longer available.	之前选择的目标磁盘已不可用。
ShadowCopiesCleanupName	Older System Restore snapshots	旧的系统还原快照（卷影副本）
ShadowCopiesCleanupDescription	Removes older shadow snapshots while keeping the newest restore point intact and without disabling System Restore. Shown size is total shadow storage (upper bound), as the newest snapshot remains.	删除较旧的卷影快照并保留最新一份还原点，不会关闭系统还原功能。显示大小为卷影总占用（可回收上限），最新快照仍会保留。
HibernationDiskSpaceName	Hibernation file (hiberfil.sys)	休眠文件（hiberfil.sys）
HibernationDiskSpaceDescription	Manage hiberfil.sys right here: "Reduce" shrinks it to keep Fast Startup only; "Off" deletes it completely to reclaim the most space (disables Hibernation and Fast Startup); "Restore" re-enables full hibernation.	管理休眠文件占用：“缩减”可减小体积并保留快速启动；“关闭”将彻底删除文件以释放全部空间（同时停用休眠与快速启动）；“恢复”可重新开启完整休眠。
HibernationReduce	Reduce	缩减
HibernationOff	Turn off	关闭
HibernationRestore	Restore	恢复
HibernationModeUnknown	Mode: unknown (rescan to check)	当前模式：未知（请重新扫描）
HibernationModeOff	Mode: off	当前模式：已关闭
HibernationModeReduced	Mode: reduced (Fast Startup only)	当前模式：已缩减（仅快速启动）
HibernationModeFull	Mode: full hibernation	当前模式：完整休眠
HibernationModeMismatch	Windows did not apply the requested hibernation mode.	Windows 未能切换到请求的休眠模式。
HibernationConfirmReduced	Shrink hiberfil.sys? Full hibernation will be disabled while Fast Startup remains available.	缩减 hiberfil.sys？将停用完整休眠，但保留快速启动支持，并重置自定义休眠文件比例。
HibernationConfirmOff	Turn off hibernation and delete hiberfil.sys? Both Hibernation and Fast Startup will be disabled (Sleep still works).	关闭休眠并删除 hiberfil.sys？将同时停用休眠与快速启动（“睡眠”功能仍正常）。
HibernationConfirmFull	Restore full hibernation? This will recreate hiberfil.sys and use disk space.	恢复完整休眠？将重新创建 hiberfil.sys 并占用一定系统盘空间。
OldDriversCleanupName	Old driver store packages	驱动库中的旧版本驱动
OldDriversCleanupDescription	Removes unused older driver versions (especially old GPU drivers that pile up gigabytes) while keeping the newest and active drivers. Only gives up rolling back to removed older driver versions.	删除已不再使用的旧版本驱动包（显卡驱动更新久了常堆积数 GB），始终保留最新版本及设备正在使用的驱动；代价仅是无法回滚到这些旧版驱动。
GraphicsNvidiaDownloaderCleanupName	NVIDIA downloaded installers	NVIDIA 下载缓存安装包
GraphicsNvidiaDownloaderCleanupDescription	Clears ProgramData\NVIDIA Corporation\Downloader (old downloaded driver setups). Completely safe once installation finishes; does not affect the installed driver.	清理 ProgramData\NVIDIA Corporation\Downloader 中的驱动下载缓存。安装完成后即可放心清理，不影响已装显卡驱动。
GraphicsNvidiaInstallerCleanupName	NVIDIA Installer2 cache	NVIDIA Installer2 安装缓存
GraphicsNvidiaInstallerCleanupDescription	Clears Program Files\NVIDIA Corporation\Installer2 (kept for repairing/reinstalling NVIDIA components). Safe to delete to reclaim hundreds of MB; future repairs simply re-download the installer.	清理 Program Files\NVIDIA Corporation\Installer2（常占数百 MB）。安全可清，不影响已装驱动，仅日后修复安装时需重新下载安装包。
GraphicsNvidiaRootCleanupName	NVIDIA extracted installer folder	C:\NVIDIA 解压安装残留
GraphicsNvidiaRootCleanupDescription	Removes the extracted driver setup files in C:\NVIDIA. Safe once driver installation is complete; close any NVIDIA installer first and ensure you haven't stored personal files there.	清理系统盘根目录的 NVIDIA 驱动解压残留。驱动装完后即可安全删除，请确认未在其中存放个人文件。
GraphicsAmdRootCleanupName	AMD extracted installer folder	C:\AMD 解压安装残留
GraphicsAmdRootCleanupDescription	Removes the extracted driver setup files in C:\AMD. Safe once driver installation is complete; close any AMD installer first and ensure you haven't stored personal files there.	清理系统盘根目录的 AMD 驱动解压残留。驱动装完后即可安全删除，请确认未在其中存放个人文件。
GraphicsInstallerBusy	A graphics driver installer is running. Finish or close it first, then try again.	检测到显卡驱动安装程序正在运行，请完成或关闭后再试。
InstallerBaselineCleanupName	Windows Installer patch baseline cache	Windows Installer 补丁基线缓存
InstallerBaselineCleanupDescription	Clears only Windows\Installer\$PatchCache$ while keeping all other Installer metadata intact. Trade-off: repairing or uninstalling certain MSI updates later may ask for the original installer.	仅清理 Windows\Installer\$PatchCache$，保留其余安装元数据。代价是今后修复或卸载部分 MSI 补丁时可能需要重新提供原始安装包。
InstallerBaselineBusy	Windows Installer is busy. Wait for the current installation to finish and try again.	Windows Installer 正在运行，请等待当前安装完成后重试。
LcuCleanupName	Cumulative update staging (LCU)	系统累积更新暂存（LCU）
LcuCleanupDescription	Clears Windows\servicing\LCU once Windows Update has completed and the PC has rebooted cleanly. Automatically blocked if updates or restarts are still pending; confirm the latest update runs smoothly before cleaning.	在系统更新完成并重启正常后，清理 Windows\servicing\LCU 暂存文件。若存在待重启或更新维护中会自动阻止清理，确认更新无异常即可放心释放。
LcuNeedsReboot	Restart Windows and rescan before cleaning LCU staging files.	请先重启 Windows 并重新扫描，再清理 LCU 暂存文件。
LcuServicingBusy	Windows Update servicing is active. Wait for it to finish and rescan.	Windows 更新维护正在运行，请待其完成后重新扫描。
DiskSpaceSelectAll	Select all	全选
DiskSpaceSelectNone	Select none	全不选
DiskSpaceSelectionScope	Applies to visible items in this group. Busy items are skipped, and relocation select-all requires an available target drive.	仅作用于本组当前显示项（跳过执行中的项；迁移全选需有可用目标盘）。
DiskSpaceDeveloperCleanup	Developer caches	开发工具缓存
DeveloperCacheUnsafePath	This cache points to a protected folder, project root, or symlink; skipped for safety.	该缓存路径位于受保护目录、项目根目录或包含链接，为安全起见已跳过。
DeveloperCachePathChanged	The cache location changed since the last scan. Please rescan first.	缓存路径较上次扫描已变化，请重新扫描后再清理。
DeveloperCacheBusy	A related development tool or installer is running. Close it and its background processes first.	相关开发工具或安装程序正在运行，请先彻底关闭后再试。
DeveloperPipCleanupName	pip download & wheel cache	pip 下载与 wheel 缓存
DeveloperPipCleanupDescription	Clears LocalAppData\pip\Cache (or PIP_CACHE_DIR) on the system drive. Safe to clean—installed Python environments stay untouched; future pip installs just download or build wheels again.	清理系统盘上的 pip 下载与 wheel 缓存（请先关闭 Python）。不影响已装好的虚拟环境和包，仅后续重新安装时需再次下载或编译 wheel。
DeveloperNpmCleanupName	npm package cache & logs	npm 包缓存与日志
DeveloperNpmCleanupDescription	Clears only _cacache and _logs inside npm's cache directory. Safe to clean—project node_modules, credentials, and npx cache stay intact; future installs just re-download packages.	仅清理 npm 缓存目录中的 _cacache 与 _logs（请先关闭 Node.js）。保留项目 node_modules、凭据与 npx 缓存，仅后续安装需重新下载。
DeveloperNpxCleanupName	npx temporary tool cache	npx 临时工具缓存
DeveloperNpxCleanupDescription	Clears only _npx temporary packages inside npm's cache. Safe to clean—global tools and project dependencies stay intact; npx tools simply download again on next run.	仅清理 npm 缓存中的 _npx 临时包（请先关闭 Node.js）。保留全局工具和项目依赖，下次运行 npx 时按需重新下载。
DeveloperYarnCleanupName	Yarn Classic cache	Yarn Classic 包缓存
DeveloperYarnCleanupDescription	Clears LocalAppData\Yarn\Cache (or YARN_CACHE_FOLDER) on the system drive. Safe to clean; future Yarn installs simply re-download packages.	清理系统盘上的 Yarn Classic 包缓存（请先关闭 Node.js）。不影响已有项目，仅后续安装需重新下载。
DeveloperGradleCleanupName	Gradle dependency & build cache	Gradle 依赖与构建缓存
DeveloperGradleCleanupDescription	Clears only the caches folder under .gradle / GRADLE_USER_HOME while keeping settings, credentials, JDKs, and wrapper distributions intact. Next builds will re-download dependencies (close Gradle daemons first).	仅清理 .gradle 下的 caches 目录（请先关闭 Gradle 守护进程），保留配置、凭据、JDK 和发行包；下次构建会重新拉取依赖（离线环境需注意）。
DeveloperGradleDistributionsCleanupName	Gradle Wrapper distributions	Gradle Wrapper 发行包
DeveloperGradleDistributionsCleanupDescription	Clears downloaded Gradle binaries under wrapper\dists while keeping project wrapper scripts intact. Each needed Gradle version will re-download automatically on next build.	仅清理 wrapper\dists 中已下载的 Gradle 发行包（请先关闭 Gradle 守护进程），保留项目脚本；下次构建会自动按需重新下载。
DeveloperMavenCleanupName	Maven local repository	Maven 本地仓库（.m2）
DeveloperMavenCleanupDescription	Clears .m2\repository on the system drive while keeping settings.xml. Warning: locally installed or private artifacts that aren't hosted on a remote repo cannot be re-downloaded—back them up first.	清理系统盘上的 .m2\repository（保留 settings.xml，请先关闭 Java）。注意：仅存于本地的私有构件无法重新下载，清理前请确认已备份。
DeveloperCargoCleanupName	Cargo crate download cache	Cargo 已下载 crate 压缩包
DeveloperCargoCleanupDescription	Clears only registry\cache under .cargo / CARGO_HOME while keeping installed binaries, credentials, extracted sources, and toolchains intact. Safe to clean; crates re-download only when needed.	仅清理 .cargo 下的 registry\cache（请先关闭 Cargo/rustc），保留已装工具、凭据、源码与工具链。安全可清，需要时按需重新下载。
DeveloperGoBuildCleanupName	Go build cache	Go 编译构建缓存
DeveloperGoBuildCleanupDescription	Clears LocalAppData\go-build (or GOCACHE) on the system drive while keeping source code and module downloads intact. Safe to clean—the next build just compiles from scratch once.	清理系统盘上的 Go 构建缓存（请先停止 Go 构建），保留源码与已下载模块。安全可清，仅下次构建会慢一次。
DeveloperVsComponentModelCleanupName	Visual Studio component cache	Visual Studio 组件模型缓存
DeveloperVsComponentModelCleanupDescription	Clears only ComponentModelCache for installed Visual Studio versions (close VS first). Safe to clean—settings and extensions stay intact and the cache rebuilds automatically on next launch (often fixes extension glitches too).	仅清理 Visual Studio 各版本的 ComponentModelCache（请先关闭 VS）。保留所有设置与扩展，下次启动自动重建，还能顺带修复部分扩展加载异常。
DeveloperVsCodeCleanupName	VS Code runtime cache	VS Code 运行缓存
DeveloperVsCodeCleanupDescription	Clears Cache, Code Cache, CachedData, and GPUCache in standard VS Code folders (close VS Code first). Settings, extensions, workspaces, and unsaved drafts are untouched.	清理标准 VS Code 目录中的 Cache、Code Cache、CachedData 与 GPUCache（请先关闭 VS Code）。完全保留设置、扩展、工作区、本地历史和未保存草稿。
DeveloperPackageCacheCleanupName	Visual Studio / shared Package Cache	VS / 共享安装程序 Package Cache
DeveloperPackageCacheCleanupDescription	Clears ProgramData\Package Cache shared by Visual Studio prerequisites and other installers. Trade-off: repairing, modifying, or uninstalling older components later may need original installers (some may no longer be online). Back up if unsure.	清理 VS 前置组件及其他安装程序共享的 ProgramData\Package Cache。代价是日后修复、修改或卸载旧组件时可能需要重新提供原始安装包（部分旧包可能已下架），请按需谨慎清理。
PnpmStoreCleanupName	pnpm unreferenced store packages	pnpm store 未引用冗余包
PnpmStoreCleanupDescription	Runs "pnpm store prune" to remove packages no longer referenced by any project while preserving all project node_modules and global tools. Displayed size is the full store (upper bound, not guaranteed savings).	执行 pnpm store prune 仅清理不再被任何项目引用的冗余包，保留所有项目的 node_modules 与全局工具。显示大小为 store 总占用（可回收上限）。
PnpmStoreQueryFailed	Could not locate pnpm's store path. Verify pnpm is installed and configured properly.	无法识别 pnpm store 路径，请检查已安装的 pnpm 及其配置。
PnpmStoreCommandFailed	pnpm prune failed. Stop any running installs or store server and try again.	pnpm 清理未完成，请先停止正在进行的安装或 store server 后重试。
PnpmNotInstalled	pnpm is not installed. Install pnpm and restart the app to scan.	未检测到 pnpm，安装后重启本程序即可扫描。
WslMigrationDescription	Moves this WSL 2 virtual disk to another NTFS drive using WSL's native --manage --move command. Stops the distribution during transfer; save work and back up important data first (Windows bind mounts stay untouched).	使用 WSL 原生 --manage --move 命令将此 WSL 2 虚拟磁盘迁移到其他 NTFS 盘，大幅释放系统盘空间。迁移期间会停止该发行版，请先保存工作并备份重要数据（挂载的 Windows 目录不受影响）。
DockerLegacyMigrationDescription	Moves the legacy Docker Desktop WSL data distribution to another drive. Quit Docker Desktop and stop all containers first, and back up important volumes.	通过 WSL 迁移旧版 Docker Desktop 数据发行版以释放系统盘空间。请先停止容器并退出 Docker Desktop，提前备份重要数据卷。
WslMigrationUpdateRequired	Your WSL version does not support --manage --move. Run "wsl --update" and try again.	当前 WSL 版本不支持 --manage --move，请先运行 wsl --update 更新后再试。
WslMigrationVersionRequired	Native disk migration requires a WSL 2 distribution.	原生虚拟磁盘迁移仅支持 WSL 2 发行版。
WslMigrationMissing	This WSL distribution is no longer registered. Please rescan.	此 WSL 发行版已不存在，请重新扫描。
WslMigrationMoving	Stopping distribution and moving virtual disk…	正在停止发行版并迁移虚拟磁盘…
DockerMigrationName	Docker Desktop virtual disk	Docker Desktop 虚拟磁盘数据
DockerMigrationDescription	Moves Docker Desktop's managed WSL 2 disk to another NTFS drive, verifies data integrity, and links it back via an NTFS directory junction so Docker works transparently. Quit Docker Desktop first and back up important volumes.	将 Docker Desktop 的虚拟磁盘迁移到其他 NTFS 盘，校验完整后通过目录联接无缝衔接原路径，Docker 无需改配置即可继续使用。请先彻底退出 Docker Desktop 并备份重要数据卷。
DockerMigrationStopRequired	Please quit Docker Desktop and its background processes first. If the disk stays locked, save WSL work and run "wsl --shutdown".	请先彻底退出 Docker Desktop 及其后台进程；若磁盘仍被占用，请保存 WSL 工作后执行 wsl --shutdown。
DockerMigrationLayoutUnsupported	This Docker storage layout cannot be migrated automatically. Change the disk image location in Docker Desktop → Settings → Resources → Advanced.	当前 Docker 存储布局暂不支持自动迁移，请在 Docker Desktop 的 Settings → Resources → Advanced 中修改磁盘映像位置。
DockerMigrationMissing	No managed Docker Desktop WSL disk found. Legacy Docker data appears as a separate WSL distribution if present.	未发现新版 Docker 托管磁盘；如为旧版 Docker 数据，会以独立 WSL 发行版形式显示。
DockerMigrationCopying	Copying Docker virtual disk…	正在复制 Docker 虚拟磁盘…
DockerMigrationVerifying	Verifying copied Docker disk…	正在校验已复制的 Docker 虚拟磁盘…
DockerMigrationRecoveryRequired	A previous migration backup or junction already exists. Inspect it before retrying: {0}	检测到上次迁移留下的备份或联接，请先检查后再重试：{0}
DockerMigrationCleanupRequired	Docker now points to the new location, but removing old files failed. Keep the new location and inspect old path {0} and backup {1} manually.	已成功切换到新位置，但清理旧文件失败。请保留新位置数据，手动检查旧路径 {0} 与备份 {1} 后再清理。
VirtualDiskMigrationInvalidPath	Choose a standalone local NTFS folder without symbolic links or junctions.	请选择不含符号链接或目录联接的本地独立 NTFS 目录。
VirtualDiskMigrationTargetExists	Destination folder already exists and will not be overwritten. Choose another drive or move the existing folder aside first.	目标目录已存在，为防误覆盖已中止迁移；请更换磁盘或先移走现有目录。
VirtualDiskMigrationNoSpace	Not enough free space on the destination drive for this virtual disk.	目标磁盘剩余空间不足以容纳该虚拟磁盘。
VirtualDiskMigrationVerificationFailed	Post-copy verification failed. Both copies were kept intact; inspect them before retrying.	迁移校验失败，已保留原路径和目标路径两份数据，请检查后再试。
Startup	Startup	启动项
StartupDescription	Whitelist-based startup control: only entries you allow may run at startup, and anything new waits for your decision. Choices are remembered permanently and sync across your PCs via the settings folder.	采用白名单模式管理开机自启：仅放行你允许的项目，新出现的启动项会等待你决定。所有选择都会永久记住，并可随配置目录同步到你的其他电脑，提前拦截曾禁止过的软件。
StartupKindLogonRegistry	Logon entries	登录启动项
StartupKindStartupFolder	Startup folder	启动文件夹
StartupKindScheduledTask	Scheduled tasks	计划任务
StartupKindService	Services	系统服务
StartupKindDriver	Drivers	驱动程序
StartupKindExplorerExtension	Explorer extensions	资源管理器扩展
StartupUnsigned	Unsigned	未签名
StartupFileMissing	Missing file	文件已不存在
StartupSignatureInvalid	Invalid signature	签名无效
StartupStatusPending	Pending decision	待决定
StartupStatusApplying	Applying…	正在应用…
StartupStatusAllowed	Allowed	已允许
StartupStatusAllowedButOff	Allowed (currently off)	已允许（当前未启用）
StartupStatusDenied	Denied	已禁止
StartupStatusDeniedNotApplied	Denied (still running)	已禁止（仍在运行）
StartupStatusReadOnly	Read-only	只读
StartupStatusPolicyManaged	Managed by Group Policy	由组策略管理
StartupStatusRunOnce	Runs once, then removes itself	仅运行一次，随后自动删除
StartupStatusBootCritical	Boot-critical driver (protected)	开机关键驱动（受保护，不作修改）
StartupStatusTaskProtected	Protected by system permissions	受系统权限保护
StartupApplyFailed	Failed to apply: {0}	应用失败：{0}
StartupDecidedOnOtherMachine	Decided on {0}	在 {0} 上已决定
StartupDecidedByLooseMatch	Matched decision from another startup location of the same program	已沿用同一程序在其他启动位置的选择
StartupSummary	{0} total · {1} pending · {2} denied but running	共 {0} 项 · {1} 项待决定 · {2} 项已禁止但仍在运行
StartupBaselinePrompt	No startup baseline on this PC yet ({0} entries found). Accept the current state as your starting baseline—enabled items become Allowed and disabled ones become Denied without changing Windows—so you only review newly added items later.	本机尚未建立启动项基线，当前共检测到 {0} 个项目。可先将现状接受为起点（已开启的记为允许、已关闭的记为禁止，不会改动系统），此后只需审批新冒出来的启动项。
StartupAcceptBaseline	Accept current state as baseline	接受当前状态为基线
StartupBaselineConfirm	Record the current state of {0} entries as your baseline? Running items will be marked Allowed and off items marked Denied; nothing on Windows will be changed.	将当前 {0} 个项目的状态记录为基线吗？目前开启的记为“允许”，已关闭的记为“禁止”，系统本身不会发生任何改动。
StartupRescan	Rescan	重新扫描
StartupEnforce	Apply denied items	清理已禁止项
StartupEnforceConfirm	Disable {0} startup item(s) that are marked Denied but still enabled?	立即关闭这 {0} 个已标记“禁止”但仍在运行的启动项吗？
StartupEnforceResult	Disabled {0} item(s), {1} failed.	已关闭 {0} 项，失败 {1} 项。
StartupRestartExplorerPrompt	Explorer must restart for shell extension changes to take effect. Restart Explorer now?	资源管理器扩展的改动需重启文件资源管理器才会生效，是否立即重启？
StartupShowOnlyPending	Only pending	仅看待决定
StartupShowWindowsEntries	Show Windows components	显示 Windows 系统组件
StartupShowWindowsEntriesHint	Entries signed as Windows system components are hidden by default to reduce noise, but are still monitored—if one loses its Windows signature it will reappear for review.	带有 Windows 系统组件签名的项目默认隐藏以减少干扰，但仍在持续监控；一旦签名变化或失效会立即重新浮现等待审核。
StartupHideMicrosoftEntries	Hide other Microsoft entries	隐藏其他微软项目
StartupAllow	Allow	允许
StartupDeny	Deny	禁止
StartupReveal	Reveal in Explorer	在资源管理器中定位
StartupScanning	Scanning startup entries…	正在扫描启动项…
StartupScanFinished	Scan complete: {0} total, {1} pending decision.	扫描完成：共 {0} 项，{1} 项待决定。
StartupScanFailed	Startup scan failed: {0}	启动项扫描失败：{0}
StartupLedgerUnreadable	Saved decisions could not be read ({0}), so saving is paused to avoid overwriting them. This usually happens while a sync tool replaces the file and will recover automatically.	暂时无法读取启动项决策文件（{0}），为防覆盖已暂停写入。通常是同步工具正在替换文件，稍后会自动恢复。
StartupLedgerBlocked	Saving is paused while the decision file is unreadable.	决策文件暂时不可读，已暂停保存。
StartupForgetAllConfirm	Clear all {0} remembered startup decisions across this PC and every synced PC? Nothing on Windows changes, and every item will ask for your decision again.	确定清空全部 {0} 条已记住的启动项决定（包括所有同步电脑）吗？不会修改系统现有设置，但所有项目都会重新变为“待决定”。
StartupKindRunOnce	Run-once entries	一次性启动项
StartupKindInternetExplorerExtension	Browser add-ons	浏览器加载项
StartupStatusNoSwitch	No Windows toggle (view only)	Windows 未提供开关（仅供查看）
StartupStatusWithWarning	{0} ({1})	{0}（{1}）
StartupWarningServiceHasDependents	still running because {0} depend on it	仍在运行，因为 {0} 依赖此服务
StartupWarningServiceCannotStop	still running; cannot stop immediately, takes effect after reboot	仍在运行，该服务不支持即时停止，重启后生效
StartupWarningServiceStopTimedOut	still stopping after 20s	20 秒内尚未完全停止
StartupWarningServiceStopFailed	failed to stop: {0}	停止失败：{0}
StartupWarningServiceStartFailed	startup type restored, but failed to start: {0}	启动类型已恢复，但立即启动失败：{0}
StartupWarningDriverReboot	takes effect after reboot	重启后生效
ShowAllItems	Show all items	显示全部项目
StartupStatTotal	Total	总计
StartupStatPending	Pending	待决定
StartupStatEnforce	Denied · Running	已禁止但运行
StartupDelete	Delete	删除
StartupDeleteHint	Delete this startup entry because its target file is missing	目标文件已不存在，可直接删除此启动项
StartupDeleteConfirm	Delete the startup entry "{0}"?\n\nLocation: {1}\nMissing file: {2}\n\nThis permanently removes the startup registration.	确定删除启动项“{0}”吗？\n\n位置：{1}\n缺失文件：{2}\n\n此操作会永久移除该启动项注册。
StartupStatusDeleting	Deleting…	正在删除…
StartupDeleteFailed	Failed to delete: {0}	删除失败：{0}
StartupDeleteSucceeded	Deleted startup entry: {0}	已删除启动项：{0}
StartupDeleteFileExistsNow	The target file exists now; rescan before taking action.	目标文件现已存在，已取消删除，请重新扫描。
